Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.24,0:03:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，watch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.89,0:03:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.93,0:03:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Mike！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.80,0:03:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hey，Larry。- How you doing？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.71,0:03:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have you seen Nicky？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.97,0:03:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure he went with Erica。It was half day today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.71,0:03:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Parent career Day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.75,0:04:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hey。- Hey。Come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.45,0:04:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You all right？- Yeah，yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.23,0:04:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why didn't anybody tell me it was career Day？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.23,0:04:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you mean？Nicky said he was gonna tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.80,0:04:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，okay，I guess he forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.53,0:04:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,There he is。How are you，Larry？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.04,0:04:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good。How are you doing，Don？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.94,0:04:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.44,0:04:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can you believe this weather？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.48,0:04:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Chilly，right？Chilly，chilly，chilly willy the penguin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.45,0:04:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Leave me alone。Hey，why don't I go tell the little corncob you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.92,0:04:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Great。Great，that's great。Yeah，thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.76,0:04:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wow，your fiance really manages to squeeze a lot onto that belt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.10,0:04:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Stop it。- What？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.60,0:04:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？No，it's like he's…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.77,0:04:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,…the Batman of stockbrokers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.54,0:04:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Bond trader。- Bond trader。Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.77,0:05:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，how's it going with that virtual-reality driving range that you wanted to open？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.28,0:05:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Getting there，still waiting for the technology to catch up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.45,0:05:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not easy，there are a lot of moving parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.95,0:05:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，do you think Nick would like Queens？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.39,0:05:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，no，Larry。You didn't get evicted again，did you？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.52,0:05:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.39,0:05:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,…get evicted。I didn't get evicted，no。I mean，I didn't…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.56,0:05:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No，I didn't get evicted yet。It's like… - Larry，listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.80,0:05:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know how much more Nicky can take.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.80,0:05:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Every couple months，it's a new career，a new apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.60,0:05:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,If it wasn't for Nicky，I wouldn't say anything，I would stay out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.04,0:05:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's just，it's too much instability。It's not good for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.94,0:05:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm trying to figure things out right now，okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.32,0:05:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.82,0:05:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,…I don't think that Nicky should stay with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.56,0:05:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What？- Just until you get really settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.09,0:05:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.86,0:05:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hey，ready to carve it up？- Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.84,0:06:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，good！Take it，Nicky！Break away！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.61,0:06:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What are you doing？- Hey，Nicky！Are you all right？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.55,0:06:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You okay？- I'm fine。Would you get off the ice？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.85,0:06:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen。Their left defenseman is a very weak skater.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.46,0:06:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,So you go left side，you got a clear shot at the goal。Okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.46,0:06:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Cool，thanks。- All right，man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.36,0:06:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're good here。We're good。All right。As you were，skaters.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.37,0:06:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Game on！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.20,0:06:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.94,0:06:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm telling you，you tore it up out there today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.37,0:06:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thinking the NHL is a serious possibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.04,0:06:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't really wanna be a hockey player anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.05,0:06:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- All right。What do you wanna be？- A bond trader.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.52,0:06:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,A bond trader？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.92,0:06:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，it's what Don does。He took me to his office last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.69,0:06:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.16,0:06:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,So you wanna dress up in a monkey suit and tie every day？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.00,0:07:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Like an automaton robot？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.40,0:07:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Trust me，you can't play hockey in a cubicle。Kind of awkward.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.10,0:07:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，he's got a pretty big office.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.91,0:07:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's not the point。Come on，you love hockey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.48,0:07:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I still like it，but bond trading's my fallback.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.78,0:07:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your fallback？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.71,0:07:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait a minute。You're too young to have a fallback，okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.92,0:07:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,And also，where did you ever even hear that word？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.75,0:07:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mom was talking to Don about all your different schemes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.99,0:07:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,She called them schemes？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.53,0:07:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,She said it was time you found a fallback.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.80,0:07:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you really moving again？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.20,0:07:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know。We'll see。I mean…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.64,0:07:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,…there's some pretty cool places out in Queens.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.24,0:07:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah。- Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.01,0:07:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Nicky，look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.08,0:07:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look at me，man。I wanna tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.55,0:07:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know that things have been kind of up and down for me lately…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.95,0:07:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and that's been hard for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.12,0:08:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I really feel like my moment's coming and when it does…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.99,0:08:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,…everything's just gonna come together，you know？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.16,0:08:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,What if you're wrong…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.60,0:08:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and you're just an ordinary guy who should get a job？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.47,0:08:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，well…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.18,0:08:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know what，we'll figure it out，okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.48,0:08:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right？Come on，let's get you back to Mom's.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.23,0:08:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Daley，I can honestly say，in 43 years at this agency…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.66,0:08:41.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,…l've never seen a resume quite like yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.00,0:08:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.13,0:08:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,That wasn't a compliment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.10,0:08:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,It says here you were the cEo…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.11,0:08:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,…of Snaptime Industries.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.84,0:08:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Care to elaborate on that？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.68,0:08:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sure。Well，that was the umbrella corporation for my invention，the Snapper.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.62,0:09:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，you snap，the lights come on。Snap，they come off.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.35,0:09:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Didn't they already make that？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.22,0:09:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no，that's the clapper，which，obviously…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.06,0:09:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,…stole a bit of our thunder.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.86,0:09:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Personally，I don't really see what the big difference is，I mean：
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.43,0:09:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，whatever，but…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.00,0:09:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,…apparently there is a significant portion of the population that has trouble actually…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.47,0:09:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- …snapping。- Clapping's easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.88,0:09:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Debatable.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.88,0:09:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.38,0:09:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Debbie？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.72,0:09:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can I call you Debbie？Because…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.12,0:09:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,…I felt a connection when I entered this office…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.12,0:09:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and I don't know，I feel like you did too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.43,0:09:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't feel a connection.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.26,0:09:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.70,0:09:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,I need a job tomorrow，okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.60,0:09:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,If I don't have one…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.17,0:09:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,well，I just need it，okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.71,0:10:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.24,0:10:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,I might have one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.95,0:10:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,They've turned down everyone I've sent over there，but…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.42,0:10:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.25,0:10:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who knows？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.76,0:10:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,You might get lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.76,0:10:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Excuse me。Hi。- Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.56,0:10:56.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm Larry Daley。I've got a job interview with cecil Fredricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.73,0:10:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Right。He should still be in his office。- Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.00,0:11:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm Rebecca Hutman。I'm a docent here。- Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.64,0:11:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Let me point you in the right direction。- Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.21,0:11:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Teddy Roosevelt，right？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.65,0:11:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yes，a great visionary。- Yes，definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.48,0:11:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,He was our 4th president，right？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.72,0:11:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Twenty-sixth。- Twenty-sixth.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.12,0:11:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please don't touch the exhibits！I mean…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.26,0:11:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Riffraff.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.99,0:11:27.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Miss Hutman。I cannot tolerate this type of chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.20,0:11:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，this is a museum，not a…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.83,0:11:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you know what 「museum」 means？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.64,0:11:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,It doesn't mean，「Daddy，it's a big Tyrannosaurus thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.54,0:11:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can I touch its leg？「 No！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.51,0:11:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Work it out，please.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.51,0:11:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Will do，sir。- Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.72,0:11:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dr。McPhee，the museum director.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.02,0:11:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Seems like a fun guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.02,0:11:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Control your young，please。Can we？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.70,0:12:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello？Just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.07,0:12:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hi。I'm Larry Daley。Are you Mr。Fredricks？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.88,0:12:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Fredricks was my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.21,0:12:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am cecil。Good to meet you，Larry。Nice firm handshake.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.72,0:12:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,I like that。Tells a lot about a man。Come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.59,0:12:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's talk turkey here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.43,0:12:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,The museum is losing money，hand over fist.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.20,0:12:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I guess kids today don't care about wax figures or stuffed animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.07,0:12:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,So they're downsizing，which is code for firing…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.84,0:12:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,…myself and the other two night guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.18,0:12:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,They want to replace us with one new guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.44,0:12:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oh，sorry。- Well，what are you gonna do？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.15,0:12:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd like you to meet my two colleagues here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.89,0:12:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Reginald？Gus？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.59,0:13:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where is he？I'll beat him with my fist！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.93,0:13:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gus，this is Larry Daley，the kid who wants to be the new night guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.23,0:13:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Night guard？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.40,0:13:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，the lady at the agency said this was a museum position.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.74,0:13:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Most important position in the museum，Larry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.11,0:13:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,He looks like a weirdie.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.61,0:13:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wonderful guard，terrible people skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.18,0:13:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，listen，lunch box。Don't try anything funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.68,0:13:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,I once went nine rounds with John L。Sullivan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.12,0:13:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,You never fought John L。Sullivan in your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.12,0:13:33.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gentlemen，we have a job candidate here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.79,0:13:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's got an excellent resume，a winning attitude…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.49,0:13:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and I say let's give him a shot。What do you say？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.13,0:13:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hang on a sec。I think I might wanna have a little time just to think it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.27,0:13:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you want the job or not，snack shack？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.91,0:13:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No，no，I want the job… - welcome to the night guards，Larry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.74,0:13:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Larry，meet me up on the second floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.98,0:13:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll slip into my orthopedics and give you a little tour。Arthritic knees.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.15,0:14:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not fun getting old，my friend。Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.86,0:14:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,You really think he's the one？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.73,0:14:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.67,0:14:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.75,0:14:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gotta keep it moving，Larry。I'm pretty spry for an old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.88,0:14:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is the Diorama Room.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.22,0:14:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.69,0:14:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,I remember these little guys。Cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.76,0:14:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cecil！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.50,0:14:54.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，cecil！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.78,0:15:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Did I get you good？- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.49,0:15:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,You got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.06,0:15:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Seriously，though，no fooling around in here。This stuff is really old.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.46,0:15:26.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，then。As you can see，it's pretty quiet in here these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.87,0:15:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,On the left there is your Attila the Hun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.74,0:15:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,And here we have our Easter Island head.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.48,0:15:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，cecil.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.32,0:15:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,And this，of course，is the Hall of African Mammals.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.02,0:15:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ah，yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.32,0:15:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Monkeys。I love monkeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.33,0:15:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah。- Guy's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.26,0:15:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，we call him Dexter。He's quite a little…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.14,0:16:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,…ball of fun，aren't you，Dexter？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.51,0:16:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Moving on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.41,0:16:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,And，finally，this is the temple of the Pharaoh Ahkmenrah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.52,0:16:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,And in that tomb right down there，the pharaoh himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.39,0:16:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Neat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.89,0:16:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,And hanging on the wall behind him…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.29,0:16:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,…was his most prized possession，the Tablet of Ahkmenrah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.03,0:16:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Twenty-four-carat gold。It's worth a fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.57,0:16:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Very cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.47,0:16:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,It is indeed，Larry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.17,0:16:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Very cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.18,0:16:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。Report here at 5 tomorrow。We'll walk you through your duties.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.52,0:16:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，5。I'll be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.55,0:16:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Moving on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.92,0:16:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，it's me。So I got a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.19,0:16:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Larry，that's great。What is it？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.70,0:17:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a job…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.03,0:17:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,…at the Museum of Natural History.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.47,0:17:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，so you can tell Nicky that we won't be moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.34,0:17:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Larry，this is good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.67,0:17:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，no，definitely。So I'll see you tomorrow？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.51,0:17:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Okay。- Okay，bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.32,0:17:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Larry？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.19,0:17:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your keys。Your torch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.03,0:17:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Right。- You'll wanna strap those to your belt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.00,0:17:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,It can get a little spooky around here at night…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.43,0:17:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,…so you might wanna put a few lights on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.87,0:17:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，flashlight，keys。What am I for…？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.71,0:17:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,The instruction manual.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.71,0:17:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Instructions.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.21,0:17:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,You start with one，two，three…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.51,0:17:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Four？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.02,0:17:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you cracking wise？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.98,0:17:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,I ought to punch you in the nose，hopscotch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.05,0:18:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Leave him alone，Gus。You got it covered，right，Larry？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.22,0:18:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，yeah，I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.53,0:18:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You better get it！- Gus.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.10,0:18:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Larry，do them in order，do them all and do them quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.77,0:18:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,And the most important thing of all to remember：Don't let anything in or out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.24,0:18:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Out？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.54,0:18:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good luck，son.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.41,0:18:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Night，Gus。- Young buck。Cracking wise.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.48,0:18:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Moving on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.05,0:18:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.78,0:19:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.78,0:19:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Check！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.65,0:19:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Check.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.52,0:19:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am Larry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.29,0:19:14.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Check！Larry！Larry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.54,0:19:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Monday！Monday！Monday！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.14,0:19:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Monster Truck Rally.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.65,0:20:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cecil？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.39,0:20:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，very funny，cecil！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.90,0:20:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is this，like a David copperfield thing？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.94,0:21:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.92,0:21:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cecil？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.37,0:22:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。Revolve。Revolve！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.49,0:22:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Name，please？- Cecil…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.49,0:22:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- …Fredricks！- One moment。Connecting.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.03,0:22:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hello。- Cecil！It's Larry Daley！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.26,0:22:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Larry。Yes，how can I help you？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.50,0:22:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,The dinosaur… The dinosaur is alive！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.24,0:22:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm having a little trouble hearing you，friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.54,0:22:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tequila.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.01,0:22:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,The dinosaur's alive！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.01,0:22:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do I do？Tell me what to do！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.58,0:22:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Read the instructions。It explains everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.75,0:22:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，I got them！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.52,0:22:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'll see you tomorrow。- Wait！What…？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.13,0:23:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,What bone？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.59,0:24:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fetch？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.89,0:24:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Play fetch？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.72,0:24:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.53,0:24:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Dum-dum。- Yes？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.37,0:24:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You give me gum-gum。- I give you gum-gum？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.44,0:24:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,You new dum-dum。You give me gum-gum.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.14,0:25:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，you know what？I have no gum-gum。Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.44,0:25:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,And my name isn't dum-dum，my name's Larry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.48,0:25:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，your name dum-dum.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.45,0:25:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，you in trouble，dum-dum.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.55,0:25:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'd better run-run from Attila the Hun-Hun.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.49,0:25:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,See you later，dum-dum.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.26,0:25:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is happening？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.24,0:26:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.78,0:26:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,How you doing？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.51,0:26:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you…？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.88,0:26:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.02,0:26:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Sakagahwahwaya」？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.35,0:26:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're 「Sakagawaya」？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.02,0:26:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，Sakagawea。You're Sakagawea？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.43,0:26:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,The glass。I can't…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.26,0:27:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,…hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.03,0:27:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can't…？You can't hear me？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.77,0:27:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me。「Who assisted the Lewis and clark…」
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.50,0:27:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right，so that's Lewis and clark and you're… Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.87,0:27:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,You seem… I'm Larry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.78,0:27:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's going on？What's…？Do you know what's going on here？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.45,0:27:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Huns。I gotta…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.00,0:28:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey。Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.00,0:28:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tin Man。Hey。Hi。How you doing？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.57,0:28:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm new。It says I'm supposed to lock up the lions or they'll eat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.71,0:28:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're Galileo？No？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.36,0:28:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.00,0:28:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，I'm the…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.47,0:28:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hi。I'm the new guy and I'm just locking up，so…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.87,0:28:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,If it's cool with you I'm just gonna get my paperwork…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.88,0:28:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and be out of your hair，okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.94,0:29:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Double-check your belt。The monkey probably stole your keys.」
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.84,0:30:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.45,0:30:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey。Hey there。Hi。What's your name？Your name is…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.05,0:30:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no，no。Come back。Come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.45,0:30:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dewey？Is that your name，Dewey？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.59,0:30:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no，no。What's…？Dewey？Dexter？Dexter。Dexter，right？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.73,0:30:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Dexter，you wanna give me those keys？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.10,0:30:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just want to lock up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.50,0:30:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes。Oh，good。Come to Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.80,0:30:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，thank you。Can I have those keys？Oh，good。What a good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.64,0:30:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's okay。Oh，thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.74,0:30:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，no，no，no。It's okay。Thank you very，very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.63,0:30:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bad monkey。Stop that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.63,0:31:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's not right。Are you done？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.01,0:31:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you have an issue with me？Do you have an issue with me？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.74,0:31:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Because if I have a problem with somebody，I don't pee on them，okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.01,0:31:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,And also… Let me tell you something。These keys？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.28,0:31:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey。Dexter，that's not funny。Give it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.75,0:31:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dexter。Give…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.62,0:31:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't。I know what you're thinking。Don't do it。Not a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.03,0:31:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not… Dexter，I need those.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.30,0:31:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't encourage him。You think you're funny for your friends，huh？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.60,0:31:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,You three guys… what，he's the ringleader，you're the audience？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.84,0:31:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，no。Don't do it，okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.70,0:31:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lookit… You！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.55,0:31:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，this is not happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.20,0:32:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，man.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.46,0:32:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you guys doing？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.03,0:32:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't feel my lip.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.10,0:32:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.60,0:32:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.06,0:33:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey。Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.23,0:33:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，stop that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.24,0:33:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hog-tie him，boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.28,0:33:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Get him，that big old Bocephus of a man。- Hey，what are you doing？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.51,0:33:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cinch him up good。You ain't so big now，are you？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.02,0:33:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey。Hey，stop that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.75,0:33:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Every night，year after year…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.52,0:33:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,…one of you guards locks us up in these boxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.16,0:33:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I hereby say，sir，enough！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.07,0:33:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fire up the iron horse，boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.41,0:33:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hey，blondie？- Name's Jedediah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.25,0:33:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，Jedediah。Stop the train，please.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.41,0:34:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- That's a big no-can-do，cracker Jack。- What's going on here，huh？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.18,0:34:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Somebody's gotta pay。- Pay for what？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.59,0:34:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know。Just pay。Now，stop whining and just take it like a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.06,0:34:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Seriously，stop the train.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.80,0:34:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- All right，stop the train。- Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.83,0:34:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now full speed ahead and ram him！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.07,0:34:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Split his head like a watermelon！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.07,0:34:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,For crying out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.88,0:34:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，that's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.58,0:34:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,We got a breach.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.42,0:34:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got him。I got him。I got him，guys。I got him…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.16,0:34:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- oh，my… - Prepare the catapults.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.80,0:34:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Octavius，hold on。This ain't your fight。This here giant's on our land.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.61,0:35:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，little guy。Jed？Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.21,0:35:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry，look。I just… I'm not a giant。I'm just an average-sized…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.31,0:35:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't talk down to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.18,0:35:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not a giant，guys。All right？You guys are really little.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.48,0:35:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,We may be small，but our hearts are large…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.85,0:35:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,…metaphorically speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.12,0:35:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't take that wrong。I'm saying you're miniatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.63,0:35:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Silence！The Roman Empire knows no boundaries.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.63,0:35:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Don't you do it，son。- Do what？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.36,0:35:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Octavius。- Don't do what？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.93,0:35:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Unleash hell！- Don't…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.21,0:35:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,climb aboard，boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.15,0:35:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take the hand，son.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.45,0:35:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Onboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.42,0:35:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's right。You better run，boy。You hear Jedediah？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.46,0:35:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,That mustachioed horseman ain't always gonna be there to protect you，you hear me？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.90,0:36:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Thank you。- Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.64,0:36:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Theodore Roosevelt，26th president…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.67,0:36:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,…of these United States of America at your service.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.47,0:36:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay。I'm Larry Daley，the new night guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.92,0:36:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pleasure to me you，Lawrence Daley。You'll have to excuse me，though.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.02,0:36:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,The hunt is afoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.36,0:36:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hunt's afoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.39,0:36:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me，Mr。President。Could I ask you something？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.93,0:36:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yes，but just one question。- All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.13,0:36:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，why？Is it just some，like，three-wishes kind of deal，or…？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.10,0:36:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not at all。Self-reliance is the key to a vigorous life.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.54,0:36:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,A man must look inward to find his own answers。How can I be of help？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.91,0:36:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't really know how to put this，and please don't take it the wrong way…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.71,0:36:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,…but isn't everything in this museum supposed to be，you know…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.38,0:36:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- …dead？- Dead？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.12,0:36:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah。- Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.89,0:36:59.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yell all you want，pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.56,0:37:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,You've been in there 54 years。You're not getting out tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.90,0:37:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's the source of all this commotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.77,0:37:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Tablet of Ahkmenrah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.71,0:37:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Arrived here in 1952 from the Nile expedition.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.41,0:37:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,On that night，everything in this museum came to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.42,0:37:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,And every night since.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.42,0:37:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,So everything in the museum comes to life every night？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.93,0:37:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.96,0:37:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I'm supposed to do what？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.80,0:37:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're the night watchman，Lawrence。A venerable position in this institution.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.81,0:37:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Come on，lad。- All right。Okay。This is impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.18,0:37:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nothing's impossible。If it can be dreamed，it can be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.94,0:37:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hence the 20-foot jackal staring at you。Don't make eye contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.31,0:37:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your job is to make sure that everyone stays inside the museum…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.95,0:37:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,…because if the sun rises and anyone's on the outside…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.65,0:38:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,…we turn to dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.29,0:38:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You turn to dust？- Dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.83,0:38:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Really？- Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.30,0:38:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，it's almost dawn。I shall help you restore order tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.47,0:38:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,But mark my words，it's the last time I shall ever do so。Is that clear？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.27,0:38:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。I mean… I mean，I guess。I don't…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.71,0:38:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop babbling，boy！Yes or no？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.04,0:38:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yes。- Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.68,0:38:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.99,0:38:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。So the Hall of Reptiles is secure.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.04,0:38:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you looking at？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.01,0:38:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm tracking，dear boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.01,0:38:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Man's got to track。Welcome to the family，Lawrence.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.25,0:39:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow night.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.52,0:39:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Actually，I gotta be honest。I don't think I'm coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.52,0:39:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？You've only just begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.85,0:39:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，well，this is not exactly what l…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.52,0:39:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Lawrence？- Yeah？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.83,0:39:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,What did you do before you took this post？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.13,0:39:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I've done a lot of different things。I invented this thing called the Snapper.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.40,0:39:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did you give up on that as well？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.17,0:39:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，I just hit a few roadblocks。You might have heard of The clapper？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.57,0:39:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Lawrence。- Yes，sir？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.04,0:39:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Some men are born great。Others have greatness thrust upon them.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.78,0:39:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,For you，this is that very moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.64,0:40:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bully。Got you，boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.11,0:40:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。You got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.35,0:40:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Say hello to your little friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.09,0:40:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What are you doing？- Put me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.39,0:40:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't like to be manhandled.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.72,0:40:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Just calm down，Jed。- It doesn't feel good.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.09,0:40:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It makes me feel small and powerless。- You done？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.87,0:40:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm gonna shoot you in your dang eye。In your dadgum eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.00,0:40:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，keep shooting。Nothing's gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.61,0:40:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now you know my shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.18,0:40:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jedediah's impotent rage。His guns don't fire。Take me away.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.28,0:40:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,This ain't over。You ain't seen the last of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.62,0:40:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't wanna hear it，okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.82,0:40:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Duck！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.12,0:40:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,The bigger they are，the harder they fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.39,0:40:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is not worth 11.50 an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.13,0:40:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，the giant's scared。There's a bigger giant running around.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.27,0:41:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.21,0:41:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Larry？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.71,0:41:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Larry？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.48,0:41:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，don't do that。We're too old for surprises.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.99,0:41:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Really？I thought you liked surprises。Like how you surprised me…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.16,0:41:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,…with the fact everything in the museum comes to life at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.82,0:41:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,That little sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.83,0:42:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,We wanted to tell you。You never would have believed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.66,0:42:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You have any idea what I've been through？- What？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.90,0:42:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You have any idea what I've been through？- Keep a lid on it，butterscotch.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.00,0:42:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know if what happened last night was real，but I didn't sign up for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.17,0:42:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just need a regular job that is not life-threatening and pays my bills.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.28,0:42:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,So thank you very much and I left my uniform in the office…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.18,0:42:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- …and I will be seeing you。- Larry！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.42,0:42:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Dad？- Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.06,0:42:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，buddy。What are you guys doing here？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.53,0:42:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，Erica had to be in court early，so I'm taking Mr。Big Stuff here to school.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.53,0:42:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,But he wanted to swing by，see you in the new job.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.20,0:42:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's so awesome that you're working here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.07,0:42:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Niko，you wanna take a little look-a-doo inside？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.74,0:42:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe your dad will give you a vlP tour.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.88,0:42:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know what？We're pretty slammed this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.48,0:42:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，but Nicky，I promise，I'll show you around soon，okay？Deal？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.22,0:42:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Deal。- All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.02,0:43:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Bye，Dad。- Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.22,0:43:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Love you。- Love you too，buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.02,0:43:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bye，now。All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.75,0:43:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Larry.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.52,0:43:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,So I was thinking maybe I'll give it one more night.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.26,0:43:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm glad you came around。Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.33,0:43:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,You。New night guard，here，now.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.31,0:43:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What's up？- 「What's up？」
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.98,0:43:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，well，take a walk with me and I'll show you，Mr.「what's up？」
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.78,0:43:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.62,0:44:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,So would you kindly do me the favor of explaining this？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.09,0:44:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay。I'm guessing…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.73,0:44:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I'm just spitballing here，but looks like that Roman dude got cocky…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.56,0:44:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and climbed over into the wild west.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.57,0:44:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,And the cowboy knows Roman dude wants to take over his territory…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.87,0:44:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,…so he rounded up a posse and put him in the stockade.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.51,0:44:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Let's all laugh at me，the comedy night guard.」
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.31,0:44:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,「No」 is the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.95,0:44:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sarcasm back at you，with your humor box.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.32,0:44:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,I wasn't laughing。Pretending to laugh…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.62,0:44:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,…if that's what you want，some sort of battle of humor.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.89,0:44:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.86,0:44:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.03,0:44:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't want… No，I don't want a battle of humor.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.83,0:44:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，you don't，because it would be a bloodbath.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.33,0:44:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nothing funny about Little Bighorn.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.04,0:45:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。I find it about as funny as a 「fancist.」
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.98,0:45:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not funny。Okay？And I will not stand for this type of blatant…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.48,0:45:12.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,If I'm not clear，tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.42,0:45:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Am I clear？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.66,0:45:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah。- Yeah？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.56,0:45:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，cecil？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.17,0:45:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,You got an extra copy of that instruction manual？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.10,0:45:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，no。I'm afraid not，Larry。Listen，I'll tell you what you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.37,0:45:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Read some books。Brush up on your history.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.11,0:45:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Helped me a lot when I first started out.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.01,0:45:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,This museum was originally dedicated to that man on the horse up there…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.02,0:45:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,…President Theodore Roosevelt.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.72,0:45:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,He absolutely loved history and believed that the more you know about the past…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.96,0:45:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,…the better prepared you are for the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.39,0:45:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，kids。Who can tell me what this room's called？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.13,0:45:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Very good。The Hall of African Mammals.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.70,0:46:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right here we have the king of the jungle，the lion.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.14,0:46:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Up ahead is one of my favorite creatures in the whole museum，the capuchin monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.41,0:46:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,A highly intelligent primate known for its loving and generous nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.42,0:46:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.92,0:46:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just thought that was…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.99,0:46:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just was laughing in agreement.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.93,0:46:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Happy monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.46,0:46:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，kids。This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.50,0:46:38.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me tell you something。I'm not buying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.81,0:46:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,You might have them fooled，you might have the kids fooled。Not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.48,0:46:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can't get past me。There's a storm coming，buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.05,0:46:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's a storm coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.52,0:46:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,One of the most famous trackers in history，Sakagawea was the woman…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.92,0:46:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,…who led Lewis and clark on their expedition to find the Pacific ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.36,0:47:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,You guys have heard the saying，「Actions speak louder than words.」
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.79,0:47:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,And yet they wrote…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.00,0:47:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yes，Mr。Daley？- Yes。Was she deaf？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.00,0:47:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Was she deaf？No。She was not。But she…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.84,0:47:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，because… Just… She does seem a little bit sort of unresponsive.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.48,0:47:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's because she's a statue.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.28,0:47:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kids，could you give me one sec？Go check her out。She's really cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.09,0:47:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What are you doing？- I'm gonna be here every night.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.76,0:47:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,I wanted to learn a little bit more about what I'm guarding.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.96,0:47:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Actually，I've got a bunch of questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.06,0:47:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe when you have a break，could I buy you a cup of coffee？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.93,0:47:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,A cup of coffee？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.43,0:47:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，I mean，just purely a，you know…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.00,0:47:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,…colleague-to-colleague，information-download sort of coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.44,0:47:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,I finish in 20 minutes。I'll meet you outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.61,0:47:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Thank you。- You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.28,0:47:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- And have a good rest of your… - All right。Okay，kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.01,0:47:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was incredible what she did.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.85,0:47:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,She literally led these men across rivers，up mountains…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.22,0:48:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,…all with her newborn baby on her back。She was the ultimate working mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.02,0:48:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wow，you are quite the Sakagawean expert.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.53,0:48:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Sakagawean。- Sakagawean？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.03,0:48:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。I should be，I've been writing my dissertation on her for four years.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.13,0:48:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,You've been working on one paper for four years？That would drive me crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.24,0:48:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Actually，it's more like a 900-page book.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.94,0:48:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，what's your story？Have you always wanted to be a security guard？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.75,0:48:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oh，I didn't mean to… - No，no，no.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.12,0:48:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，I'm divorced and I have a 10-year-old son…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.12,0:48:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,…so I needed to find a more steady situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.09,0:48:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Got it。So，what can I tell you about the museum？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.29,0:48:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，Attila the Hun。What is that guy's problem？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.56,0:48:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Attila was considered the only genuine threat to the Roman Empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.17,0:48:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Known as the 'Scourge of God'…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.17,0:48:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,…Attila and his Huns would often tear off the limbs of their helpless victims.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.81,0:48:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Attila was famous for his superstitious beliefs.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.31,0:49:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,He surrounded himself with a phalanx of sorcerers and magicians…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.58,0:49:06.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,…who advised and mystified him with their dark arts.「
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.47,0:50:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Larry？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.27,0:50:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just wanted to say good luck，son.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.18,0:50:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,And goodbye。We're clocking out for the last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.88,0:50:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you're ever in Boca，look us up.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.65,0:50:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait，you guys are going out of town？What if this doesn't work out？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.02,0:50:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Smart fellow like you？You'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.72,0:50:18.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。We'll just be a phone call away。Come on，walk us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.43,0:50:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,You fellas go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.50,0:50:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,I need a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.33,0:50:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's very emotional。A lot of memories in this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.23,0:51:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go crazy，big guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.57,0:51:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.37,0:51:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Quest for fire…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.84,0:51:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,…over。Knock yourselves out.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.88,0:51:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Morning，dum-dum.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.38,0:51:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Me no dum-dum。You dum-dum。You bring me gum-gum？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.25,0:51:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，I did，fathead。Lots and lots of gum-gum.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.10,0:52:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's that？I can't hear you through the glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.14,0:52:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.35,0:52:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Heave.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.62,0:52:25.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Heave。Heave.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.62,0:52:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，what's going on over here？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.35,0:52:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,We expand or we die.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.99,0:52:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Heave.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.33,0:52:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Heave。- On the count of three…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.13,0:52:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,…you blow this anthill to kingdom come.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.03,0:52:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- And a one and a two… - Hey，Jed。Stop that.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.64,0:52:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no。You blow a hole in your mountain，all you're gonna hit is a wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.64,0:52:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Step aside，Gigantor。We got us a railroad to build。We're blowing a hole in that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.14,0:52:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，first of all，enough with the Gigantor giant stuff，okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.65,0:52:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm just trying to close up shop。- We're gonna blow it anyway。And a three！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.85,0:53:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。What are you doing？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.76,0:53:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's it look like we're doing？It's manifest destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.06,0:53:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can't fight it and neither can I。Go！More dynamite.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.16,0:53:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah，use it all。- All right。Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.70,0:53:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen，「octavus」？You gotta stop that.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.54,0:53:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's octavius，mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.67,0:53:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，you know what？Fine。Great。Here you go。This is what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.48,0:53:24.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You cannot do this。I am a Roman general。- Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.88,0:53:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I have rights。- And you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.31,0:53:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hey，no！Put me down！- Keep heaving，men.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.98,0:53:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can't stop progress！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.45,0:53:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're gonna have a little talk，okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.39,0:53:35.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,I told you，I don't like to be manhandled.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.99,0:53:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，I will manhandle you，Jedediah。Now，listen，guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.76,0:53:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is your problem，huh？Why can't you just get along？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.56,0:53:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，we're men。We fight，okay？That's what we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.06,0:53:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's kind of how we pass the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.90,0:53:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're，like，a giant。A freak，if you will。We can't expect you to understand that.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.37,0:53:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,You got the whole room to run around in。You don't have to be near each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.71,0:53:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What，you mean…？- You're gonna let us out？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.88,0:54:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,What，and just roam free？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.98,0:54:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。Yeah，I might，if you promise to behave.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.72,0:54:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,That means no fireballs，no explosions，okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.02,0:54:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have my word，my liege.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.42,0:54:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，no problemo，Gigantor.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.26,0:54:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,My name's Larry，first of all。Okay，Jed？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.33,0:54:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,So I call you Jed。I don't call you Tiny，right？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.23,0:54:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's that supposed to mean？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.97,0:54:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 「Hey，Teeny.」 How does that sound？- I don't like it。It hurts my feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.74,0:54:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Gigantor」 makes me feel like some sort of freak，so…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.64,0:54:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't。I just call you Larry.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.28,0:54:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't be a kiss-ass，okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.45,0:54:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，I'm trusting you guys，all right？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.45,0:54:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you don't do what I say，you can end up like the Mayan world there.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.09,0:54:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Locked up。Take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.32,0:54:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Do they look happy？- No.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.76,0:54:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,They look sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.30,0:54:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,They can't do what they wanna do。Now，I'm letting you guys…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.53,0:54:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,…have a little bit of leash here。Don't choke me with it，okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.94,0:55:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I gotta run。You guys play nice，okay？Okay。Good。Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.84,0:55:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，how's that gum treating you，dum-dum？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.28,0:55:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.98,0:55:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，hey，Dexter。I'm just locking up。You want in？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.45,0:55:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.66,0:55:18.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.30,0:55:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's that？You got my keys？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.80,0:55:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.07,0:55:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Looks like Uncle Larry pulled a fast one on little Dexie.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.81,0:55:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Those are baby keys for a little baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.91,0:55:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have fun with your baby keys，little baby monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.31,0:55:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tomorrow I'll bring you a little baby diapy so you can go poo-poo in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.88,0:55:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll give you a tickle because you're a cute baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.39,0:55:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,While you cry all night long about how Uncle Larry fooled you，huh？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.66,0:55:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,I told you there was a storm coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.17,0:56:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hey，Teddy。- Lawrence.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.50,0:56:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,You impertinent pup。I knew you'd come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.34,0:56:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You look like a man on a mission。- Yeah，I'm gonna give it another shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.92,0:56:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You…？- What？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.69,0:56:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You checking her out？- The nerve.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.19,0:56:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Checking her out。I've never heard of such a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.33,0:56:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no，no。I'm just… I mean because，you know，she's very beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.43,0:56:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Beautiful？- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.24,0:56:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Rather handsome woman，I suppose。- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.27,0:56:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know，maybe you should go talk to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.01,0:56:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Indeed。Bless you，lad。- Yeah。All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.78,0:56:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Carry on。- Good。See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.99,0:57:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,I…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.48,0:57:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.85,0:58:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！It's okay！It's okay。You guys speak English？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.85,0:58:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,No？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.85,0:58:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right。I don't know what that means…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.66,0:58:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and I know that you and I got off on the wrong foot last night，but…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.66,0:58:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,…a little birdie told me that somebody likes…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.17,0:58:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,…magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.57,0:58:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Magic？- Magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.37,0:58:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorcery.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.37,0:58:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ah，sorcer…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.91,0:58:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes。Illusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.68,0:58:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everybody likes magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.38,0:58:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,And flowers。People like flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.48,0:58:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,There you go。Those are for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.19,0:58:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know what else people like？Money.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.92,0:58:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,The almighty dollar，right？But money can sometimes…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.19,0:58:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,…disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.40,0:58:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,At least that's what I…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.07,0:58:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,…hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.90,0:59:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,No wonder you can't understand me。You got a coin in your ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.04,0:59:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Check this out。Anybody need a hanky？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.05,0:59:11.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I wouldn't suggest this little feller because he has a nasty habit…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.15,0:59:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,…of vanishing…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.42,0:59:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,…into thin air！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.23,0:59:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no。Don't。That defeats the… Don't！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.45,0:59:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not the limbs。Guys，please，do not tear the limbs.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.27,1:00:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cortes，right？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.12,1:00:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,How？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.79,1:00:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,You！Don't even think about it。Don't you…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.53,1:00:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dexter！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.50,1:00:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，guys！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.40,1:01:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，guys！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.17,1:01:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，guys。Hey，guys！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.78,1:01:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry。What's going on？What happened here？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.88,1:01:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,I thought we had a deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.38,1:01:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,We will never coexist with these buffoons.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.78,1:01:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're past words，Laredo.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.88,1:01:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now it's time to let Smith & wesson do the talking！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.12,1:01:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Those guns don't even work.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.59,1:01:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,They don't？Take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.06,1:01:34.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dexter！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.61,1:02:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.75,1:02:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ho！Dexter.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.40,1:02:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,End of the line，cool breeze.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.03,1:02:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,End of the line.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.82,1:03:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am not playing games here.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.82,1:03:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just hand them over.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.70,1:03:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Easy。That's it，Dexter.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.13,1:03:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nice and easy，Dex。That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.49,1:03:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good Lord，Lawrence！Why are you slapping a monkey？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.66,1:03:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Teddy，this guy's been pushing me，and I'm sick of it！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.16,1:03:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Poppycock。This little creature is your primate brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.37,1:03:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Without him，there's no us.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.70,1:03:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you rabid？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.21,1:03:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wipe that off.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.57,1:04:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have to deal with this creature with love and respect.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.38,1:04:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,May I have the keys，dear friend？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.68,1:04:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you。Lawrence？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.18,1:04:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，you know what？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.55,1:04:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,You seem to know what you're doing，so I'm gonna let you take over.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.89,1:04:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no。My dear boy，you can't put up the white flag now.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.06,1:04:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,The museum is on the verge of total anarchy.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.23,1:04:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,I tried！I came back tonight，didn't I？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.13,1:04:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tried？That was one night。I didn't build the Panama canal in one day.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.70,1:04:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's great，but I'm dealing with the most ridiculous job in history.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.04,1:04:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Some men are born great，Lawrence…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.77,1:04:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，I know。Others have greatness thrust upon them.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.47,1:04:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,You hit me with that chestnut last night.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.48,1:04:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,The thing is，not everyone is great.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.18,1:04:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's the problem。Some of us are just ordinary.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.98,1:04:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，you're not，Lawrence。Stop wallowing in self-pity.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.79,1:04:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Every journey begins with a footstep.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.65,1:04:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Teach the inhabitants to get along，they wouldn't need to be locked up.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.09,1:04:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,That means a lot coming from a guy who's spent the last 50 years…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.43,1:04:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,…spying on a girl he's never even talked to.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.43,1:04:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was going to make contact。Lawrence，please.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.23,1:05:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm done，all right？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.44,1:05:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，Rexy！No！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.27,1:05:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，no.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.67,1:06:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.58,1:07:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,No one comes here anymore。Besides，I took this tour in second grade，Daley.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.55,1:07:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm telling you，my dad's gonna hook us up.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.26,1:07:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Mr。Daley？- Yeah？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.03,1:07:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Foam。- Yes，I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.13,1:07:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,In the Neanderthal display.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.60,1:07:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,There was an incident last night with the fire extinguisher.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.73,1:07:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was on my way to go clean it up.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.54,1:07:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，don't bother。You're fired.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.91,1:07:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't think we're getting a tour today.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.18,1:07:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your dad just got canned，dude.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.71,1:07:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.12,1:07:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。McPhee？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.58,1:07:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me，Mr。McPhee？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.19,1:07:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can I talk to you about this，please？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.69,1:07:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Sir？- What？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.99,1:07:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know I screwed up，but I finally understand how to do this job.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.06,1:07:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You obviously don't。- No，I didn't，but now I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.43,1:07:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Really，Mr。McPhee… - Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.93,1:07:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dr。McPhee.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.67,1:07:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can you please give me one more night？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.31,1:07:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- One more night。- Okay，thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.68,1:08:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,And if anything is the tiniest…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.25,1:08:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,…after your shift：
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.95,1:08:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Because…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.26,1:08:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Got it。- Okay？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.12,1:08:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fool me once，shame on you。Fool me twice…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.03,1:08:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shame on me。Fool me… Shame on me.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.17,1:08:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You。- Fool me twice… Got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.07,1:08:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Take it or leave it。- Okay。Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.48,1:08:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hey。- Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.78,1:08:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What's wrong？- Maybe you should ask Nicky.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.49,1:08:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，buddy。What's going on？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.79,1:08:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,You got fired.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.79,1:08:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you talking about？I didn't get fired.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.36,1:08:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I came to the museum this morning。I saw your boss yelling at you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.13,1:08:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell me？Everything's fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.27,1:08:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,We just had a little misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.24,1:09:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.01,1:09:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's hard to explain。I mean，you wouldn't bel…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.28,1:09:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know what？Let me show you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.68,1:09:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Show me what？- Come to work with me tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.12,1:09:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Larry？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.62,1:09:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can I talk to you for a second？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.53,1:09:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Am I in trouble？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.03,1:09:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Larry，what are you doing？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.90,1:09:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just wanna show him what I do。That's all.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.40,1:09:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,I love that you wanna share that with him，but I gotta tell you…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.60,1:09:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,…I don't think Nicky has any room in his heart for more disappointment.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.54,1:09:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,He won't be disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.84,1:09:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Larry.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.71,1:09:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,He won't be disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.82,1:09:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen，hang out in the security office till everyone's gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.56,1:09:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Then I'm gonna come get you。All right？- Okey.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.61,1:10:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，miss？I'm gonna have to ask you to vacate the premises.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.98,1:10:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hey there。- Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.95,1:10:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Good place to think，huh？- Yeah。Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.22,1:10:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,So no big plans tonight？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.89,1:10:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，no，I'm not really a big-plan person.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.09,1:10:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,I prefer hanging out with people who are dead for 200 years.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.10,1:10:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's the live ones that throw me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.80,1:10:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's cool。Seriously though，you do have to leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.27,1:10:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Seriously？- Yeah，sorry。It's museum rules.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.07,1:10:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're sort of locking everything up.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.87,1:10:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're really taking your job seriously.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.24,1:10:47.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，once I clip on the tie，I'm all business.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.81,1:10:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I get it。- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.18,1:10:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,How's that dissertation coming？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.39,1:10:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've hit a dead end。I mean，research can only get me so far.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.86,1:10:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm never gonna know who she really was.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.42,1:11:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,So I think it's time that I move on to another subject.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.20,1:11:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll let you get back to work.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.63,1:11:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Good night，Larry。- Yeah，okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.34,1:11:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Night.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.28,1:11:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.28,1:11:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Rebecca！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.45,1:11:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hey，Rebecca。- Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.86,1:11:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey。Listen，I don't think you should give up on your paper.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.29,1:11:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay。Why？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.26,1:11:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，look，this is gonna sound crazy，all right？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.20,1:11:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，it's gonna sound，like，really，really crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.97,1:11:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Okay。- No，I mean insanely crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.84,1:11:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I can handle it。- Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.47,1:11:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know how they say in certain museums，history comes alive？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.38,1:11:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah。- In this museum…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.18,1:11:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,…it actually does.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.45,1:11:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you talking about？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.56,1:12:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everything in this museum comes to life at night.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.50,1:12:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Really？- Yeah，really。I'm not kidding you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.80,1:12:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know that tablet？The Tablet of Ahkmenrah？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.20,1:12:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,It actually brings things to life。It's like some ancient spell.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.24,1:12:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Since the '50s，every night everything's been coming to life.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.21,1:12:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Teddy Roosevelt told me。Seriously。The monkey，Dexter？The cute little…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.41,1:12:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- what is he？- Capuchin.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.05,1:12:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,A capuchin。Right。The capuchin。He urinated on me and bit my nose.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.29,1:12:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,And Sakagawea is in her case，alive every night…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.39,1:12:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,…just listening to Lewis and clark argue.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.76,1:12:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,So if you really wanna get inside her head…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.60,1:12:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,…I can hook that up.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.00,1:12:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.43,1:12:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，it's cool。It's freaking awesome.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.94,1:12:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Make fun of the history geek.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.84,1:13:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No。Rebecca！- Good night，Larry.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.75,1:13:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，I'm not making fun of you。Rebecca.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.53,1:13:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Here you go。Best seat in the house。- What's going on？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.17,1:13:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,If I told you，you'd think I'm crazy。I'm gonna show you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.90,1:13:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What？- You'll see in about 20 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.61,1:13:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Okay，you like Tyrannosaurus Rex？- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.77,1:13:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah？Well，I call him Rexy.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.24,1:13:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,And he's about to come to life，Nicholas，in…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.12,1:13:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,…five，four，three，two…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.26,1:13:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Dad？- Hang on a sec.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.96,1:13:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Say hello to Rexy！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.47,1:13:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad，are you okay？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.97,1:14:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is weird.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.64,1:14:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Guys！Come on！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.31,1:14:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sundown！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.28,1:14:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，T.R.，come on，rise and shine。Buddy，I need you to wake up.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.98,1:14:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，my kid is here。I need you to wake up.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.15,1:14:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Texas？Texas！Come on！Texas！Come on！Get on，Texas！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.62,1:14:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get on，Texas！Get up.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.53,1:14:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just stop，okay？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.83,1:14:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，Nicky，I'm telling you，there's this tablet，okay？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.50,1:14:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Called the Tablet of Ahkmenrah。Every night…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.73,1:14:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Now there's a tablet？- Yeah，there is.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.57,1:14:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.57,1:14:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.71,1:14:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's gone。- What's gone？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.81,1:14:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,The tablet。I think somebody stole it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.65,1:14:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，right.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.65,1:14:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not kidding，Nicky.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.03,1:14:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nicky？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.30,1:14:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Nicky！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.70,1:15:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！Hey，Nicky！Where are you going？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.64,1:15:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Home。- What？Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.04,1:15:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.55,1:15:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,You guys shouldn't be here.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.06,1:15:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Give us the tablet，son.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.36,1:15:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait a minute，Nicky。What are you guys doing？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.56,1:15:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're not gonna hurt you。Give us the tablet.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.93,1:15:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to tell you this，son，but your dad doesn't work here.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.07,1:15:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,He got fired this morning。Couldn't hack it.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.30,1:15:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad？I thought you said you weren't fired.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.40,1:15:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,I did。They're lying，trying to steal that thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.94,1:15:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Turn the middle piece，you'll see what I was talking about.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.78,1:15:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,That is museum property，son。Give it back.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.81,1:15:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nicky，trust me。Just turn it.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.95,1:15:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Give us the tablet！- Nicky？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.78,1:15:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.64,1:16:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nick？Run。Now.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.28,1:16:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get back here，kid！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.88,1:16:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bad idea，Larry.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.98,1:16:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,You wanna dance，hot dog？You wanna dance？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.69,1:16:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gus，you're an old man。I don't wanna hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.16,1:16:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,You see，Larry，a few years into the job，the three of us realized that…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.13,1:16:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,…like everything else in this museum，we got new life at night.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.37,1:16:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sundown to sunrise，we felt young again.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.84,1:16:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay。Did not see that coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.64,1:16:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gave us an energy boost.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.37,1:16:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,We love the nightlife，Larry.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.81,1:16:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,So when we found out they were gonna fired us…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.15,1:16:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,…we had to steal the tablet.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.78,1:16:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everyone knows you need the money.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.98,1:16:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Add the stuff we planted in your place…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.02,1:17:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,…pretty obvious you committed the crime.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.32,1:17:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take care of that cut.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.39,1:17:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，guys，let's go find that kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.33,1:17:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Sweet dreams，cupcake！- No！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.53,1:17:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pile driver！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.80,1:17:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's get our tablet.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.49,1:17:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you very much。We'll take it from here.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.03,1:17:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nicky！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.57,1:17:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just in time，Larry。We were just locking up.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.87,1:17:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sleep tight，hotshot.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.77,1:17:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's grab everything we can fence.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.84,1:18:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know about you，but I'm planning on a long retirement.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.22,1:18:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Teddy！Teddy，if you're out there，I need you，pal！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.13,1:18:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Someone call my name？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.23,1:18:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Theodore Roosevelt，at your service.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.73,1:18:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Teddy，can you get us out of here？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.77,1:18:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can't do it，man。This is your moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.24,1:18:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Will you save the lectures，please？I'm not you。Okay？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.91,1:18:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't build the Panama canal，I wasn't president of the United States！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.54,1:18:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,I need some help。Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.91,1:18:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Actually…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.75,1:18:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,…I never did any of those things。Teddy Roosevelt did.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.85,1:18:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was made in a mannequin factory in Poughkeepsie.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.89,1:18:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,I never shot a wild beast.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.92,1:18:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not even brave enough to tell that beautiful woman I love her.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.63,1:18:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,But you…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.76,1:18:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,…you gotta finish the job this time。You can't quit.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.07,1:18:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm made of wax，Larry.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.77,1:19:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you made of？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.41,1:19:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Wait！That's all you got for me？- That's it！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.09,1:19:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's it。Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.93,1:19:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Duck！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.93,1:19:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go over there！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.32,1:19:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey。Hi。How you doing？Sorry to bother you…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.32,1:19:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,…but your guys there？Your jackal guys？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.53,1:19:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you think you could ask them to back off，please？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.00,1:20:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're not trying to hurt you，they think we are。Could you do it like now？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.04,1:20:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you。Nicky.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.38,1:20:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.58,1:20:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.43,1:20:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,You would not believe how stuffy it is in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.94,1:20:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- How come you speak English？- I went to cambridge University.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.14,1:20:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,You went to cambridge？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.41,1:20:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was on display in the Egyptology Department.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.14,1:20:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am Ahkmenrah，fourth king of the fourth king…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.88,1:20:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,…ruler of the land of my fathers.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.02,1:20:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am Larry…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.65,1:20:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,…son of Milton…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.65,1:20:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and this is my son，Nick.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.19,1:21:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,And we hail from Brooklyn.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.03,1:21:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I do。I mean，he comes out and stays with me on wednesdays…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.46,1:21:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and every other weekend.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.40,1:21:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,That was the custody agreement that we had.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.17,1:21:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Larry，Nick，guardians of Brooklyn…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.04,1:21:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,…I am forever in your debt.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.08,1:21:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now bestow the tablet upon me…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.91,1:21:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,…so that I may assume command of my kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.22,1:21:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，yes。Okay，the tablet。I would…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.42,1:21:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,…love to bestow it upon you，but we don't actually…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.26,1:21:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,…have it.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.73,1:21:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks，guys。Don't worry。I'll watch out for him！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.67,1:21:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.05,1:22:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is that？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.12,1:22:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Huns.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.76,1:22:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,I gotta deal with this guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.26,1:22:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pardon me，Larry。I speak Hun.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.51,1:22:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,He says that he wants to rip you apart.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.51,1:22:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。Again with the ripping。Listen，I understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.21,1:23:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,I get it。Ripping for you… You want to rip things，okay？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.88,1:23:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I think maybe that's because somebody ripped you a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.32,1:23:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,In here.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.52,1:23:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Somebody ripped little…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.86,1:23:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,…baby Attila a long time ago，right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.03,1:23:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,They ripped something out，didn't they？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.17,1:23:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,They ripped the love.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.64,1:23:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,They ripped the love right out of you，didn't they？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.84,1:23:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,A little baby all alone in a tent…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.14,1:23:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,…whose daddy went off…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.31,1:23:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,…to pillage some town…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.55,1:23:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,…or go and plunder somewhere，just doing his job.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.35,1:23:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,But who was left alone？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.86,1:23:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,You.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.87,1:23:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let it out。Let it go。Let it go.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.22,1:24:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's okay。It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.46,1:24:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're next.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.60,1:24:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good。That's good。Just breathe.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.41,1:24:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Larry Daley。- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.41,1:24:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good。Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.85,1:24:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。Okay。Good，good.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.62,1:24:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right！I need everybody to listen up！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.13,1:24:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Guys！Come on！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.36,1:25:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Quiet！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.45,1:25:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,My dum-dum want to speak.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.22,1:25:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.88,1:25:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，this here's King Ahkmenrah.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.39,1:25:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,His tablet is what brings you to life every night.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.39,1:25:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,And those old night watchmen？They stole it.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.66,1:25:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，we need to find those guards and get the tablet back…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.43,1:25:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and we need to do it before morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.50,1:25:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Civil war guys，head over to the Planetarium wing.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.84,1:25:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,My explorer friend whose name escapes me.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.84,1:25:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's columbus。- Right，columbus！Right，I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.38,1:25:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's no nameplate，so… columbus，take the Neanderthals…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.35,1:25:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and do a sweep from Invertebrates all the way through Reptiles.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.45,1:25:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jed and octavius，their van's parked out back。Go take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.69,1:25:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoa，whoa，whoa，no！No，sir。I ain't working with toga boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.89,1:25:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Romans work alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.32,1:26:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- That didn't hurt。Don't be a baby。- Yes，it did.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.69,1:26:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.43,1:26:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,That was much harder！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.26,1:26:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Guys，come on！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.57,1:26:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jed，octavius.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.84,1:26:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take away the fact you were born 2000 years apart…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.30,1:26:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,…you guys aren't that different.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.41,1:26:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're both great leaders.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.78,1:26:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,You just want what's best for your people，right？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.21,1:26:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah。- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.75,1:26:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Civil war dudes.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.02,1:26:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,You guys are brothers，for God's sakes。You gotta stop fighting.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.22,1:26:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,North wins。Slavery's bad。Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.73,1:26:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't wanna burst your bubble。But，South，you guys get Allman Brothers…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.00,1:26:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and NAScAR，so just chill！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.30,1:26:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，without that tablet，all of this…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.74,1:26:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,…this whole coming-to-life-at-night thing，it all goes away.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.61,1:26:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，I don't wanna let that happen，but I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.88,1:26:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,We can get this done，but we gotta do it together.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.38,1:27:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,So who's with me？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.99,1:27:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.82,1:27:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Who's with me？- Yeah！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.92,1:27:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah！- Charge！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.83,1:27:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right！Now，let's do this，people！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.83,1:27:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,And animals！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.00,1:27:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,And weird，faceless puppet creatures。Come on，let's go！Let's do it！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.76,1:27:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！Follow me，boys！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.87,1:27:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Geronimo！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.28,1:28:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，jeez.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.20,1:28:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，boys，we can do this the easy way or the hard way.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.80,1:28:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,I guess it's gonna be the hard way.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.94,1:28:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right，men，we're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.07,1:28:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Save yourself！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.44,1:29:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,I ain't quitting you！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.31,1:29:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gus？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.21,1:29:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Reginald？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.81,1:29:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fellas，where are you？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.95,1:29:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Guys？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.06,1:29:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's what I'm talking about。Good job，gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.73,1:29:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Loving the teamwork！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.29,1:29:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,They've vanished。How will we find them？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.76,1:29:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know someone who can help。Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.89,1:29:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Watch out！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.40,1:30:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Sakagawea，or wea。Listen，I need a favor。Somebody stole his tablet.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.44,1:30:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,You think you can track the guys who took it？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.61,1:30:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,He went east but he lost control and crashed.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.38,1:30:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're amazing。How can you tell that？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.56,1:30:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,He left the wagon…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.79,1:30:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and went back.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.79,1:30:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,He went back？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.86,1:30:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why would he go back？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.03,1:30:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get out of the way！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.64,1:30:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,You saved me.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.58,1:30:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're worth saving，my dear.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.05,1:30:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- That's problematic。- Teddy。Oh，man.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.85,1:30:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Larry，relax。I'm wax.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.32,1:30:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,You gotta do something。Dawn's approaching.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.32,1:31:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Half the museum's running amuck outside。- He's got my tablet.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.33,1:31:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，ockie！
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.37,1:31:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,At your service，Gigantor！
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.44,1:31:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,How can we be of assistance，my liege？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.84,1:31:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just give me a second，guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.15,1:31:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Rexy？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.22,1:31:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here，boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.65,1:31:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Teddy，I need a horse.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.06,1:31:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do it，man.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.84,1:31:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Come on，boy！Let me hear you yell！- Yeah！
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.58,1:31:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just living the dream，baby！
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.61,1:31:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm loving this！
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.85,1:32:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pull the stagecoach over now！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.92,1:32:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can I make this turn up here？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.59,1:32:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll take that as a yes。Hang on！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.10,1:32:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't hold it！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.45,1:32:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，Tex，let's finish this.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.62,1:32:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.99,1:32:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Give me the tablet，cecil！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.89,1:32:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can't do it，son.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.87,1:32:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pull over！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.50,1:32:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,It ain't gonna happen。Moving on.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.34,1:32:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Last chance，cecil。Stop the horses or I will！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.27,1:32:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,They can't be stopped，Larry.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.31,1:32:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't you know your history？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.15,1:33:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,These are money carriers。They were trained not to stop for anything but a secret word.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.35,1:33:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Really？You mean a word like…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.65,1:33:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,…「Dakota」？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.96,1:33:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，Tex.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.50,1:33:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,I read up on my history。Thanks for the tip.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.27,1:33:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，and by the way…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.67,1:33:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,…don't ever talk to me like that in front of my son.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.44,1:33:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Moving on.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.21,1:33:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hey，Huns。- Tell Attila to have his boys…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.32,1:33:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,…take him back。Put him with the guards.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.49,1:33:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，and no limb ripping，okay？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.04,1:34:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，boy。Wait，wait，hold the phone.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.87,1:34:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's makeekaka mean？Wait。Translation，please.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.85,1:34:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,The year was 1909。I was going up the Zambezi River in Africa.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.85,1:34:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,And our river guide was a brilliant Pygmy who spoke only by clicking.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.96,1:34:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,There we are.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.03,1:34:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oh，boy。- What is it？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.13,1:34:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,I gotta get you guys back to the museum.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.94,1:34:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,How？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.94,1:34:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ahkmenrah，I'm gonna need your help.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.51,1:34:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is your tablet。You know the instructions。You get everyone back.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.91,1:35:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。There's somebody who's gotta see this.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.18,1:35:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,What I'm saying is，for the type of money that they pay A-Rod…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.62,1:35:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,…he ought to be bringing home a world Series trophy every season.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.42,1:35:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know what I mean？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.51,1:35:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，who they gonna get to clean up all that doo-doo？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.24,1:35:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Inuit。- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.61,1:35:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,One terracotta soldier.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.48,1:35:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Vikings。- Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:50.95,1:35:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Alpaca。- Welcome back，ladies.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.05,1:35:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Llama。- Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.82,1:35:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Viking guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.32,1:35:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do me a favor。Your fellows made some funeral pyre…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.96,1:36:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,…in Petrified wood。Go clean that up.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.26,1:36:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay？Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.06,1:36:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- He's back。- All right，I'll deal with this joker.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.97,1:36:10.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，hey，Moose。It's not gonna happen，buddy。All right？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.20,1:36:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,I told you，you can't come through with those antlers.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.80,1:36:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,So you and your caribou buddy gotta go around to the loading dock.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.01,1:36:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Lawrence！- Hey，Teddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.48,1:36:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Great to see you in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.21,1:36:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sakagawea，a little hot wax，and I'm a new man.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.78,1:36:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Larry？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.99,1:36:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,I told you I wasn't making fun of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.49,1:36:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I know。- Teddy？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.63,1:36:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.63,1:36:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wanna meet her？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.10,1:36:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah？- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.50,1:36:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.81,1:36:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me。President Roosevelt，this is my friend Rebecca.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.18,1:36:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- An honor。- Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.01,1:36:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,And this is Sakagawea.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.31,1:36:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Wea。- Wea.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.38,1:36:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wea.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.05,1:36:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think she has a few questions she wants to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.75,1:37:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,You rock。I am a big fan.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.52,1:37:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,What would you like to know？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.89,1:37:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I mean，I don't know where to start，but…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.11,1:37:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- one Buddha。- Check.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.18,1:37:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Two zebras.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.21,1:37:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Right。Check。- Dexter！Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.85,1:37:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Dex，so look。No hard feelings，all right？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.06,1:37:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Lawrence！- You saw！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.79,1:37:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You saw what he did just then！- Who's evolved？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.23,1:37:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I am。- Who's evolved？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.19,1:37:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.60,1:37:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.73,1:37:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，they're all here.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.40,1:37:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well done。Everyone's in.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.07,1:37:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，well…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.94,1:37:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,…not everyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.84,1:37:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,We lost a couple of good，little men out there tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.34,1:38:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,With great victory comes great sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.22,1:38:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.72,1:38:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad，look.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:16.39,1:38:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bully！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.22,1:38:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,You ain't getting rid of us that easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:01.91,1:39:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Until tomorrow evening，Lawrence？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.24,1:39:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。I don't know about that，Teddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.28,1:39:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's gonna be tough to talk my way out of this one.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.71,1:39:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，if that's indeed the case…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.95,1:39:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,…then it's farewell，my friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.82,1:39:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nick？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.66,1:39:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your father's a great man.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.03,1:39:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.43,1:39:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Told you.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.54,1:39:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。Good night.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.67,1:39:38.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，Lawrence。Good day.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:43.68,1:39:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Teddy？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.76,1:40:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.01,1:40:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're watching New York 1。News all morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:18.58,1:40:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks for joining us。There is a fresh blanket of snow.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:21.29,1:40:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,But it's not the snow that's got New Yorkers talking.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:23.86,1:40:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's what's in the snow。There are dinosaur tracks along West 81 st Street.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.73,1:40:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here's the remarkable video。These appear to be Tyrannosaurus Rex tracks…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:32.23,1:40:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,…and they lead straight to the Museum of Natural History.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.77,1:40:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Authorities have found what appear to be cave drawings in the subway.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.04,1:40:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Neanderthals atop the museum roof。Elaborate hoax or publicity stunt？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.74,1:40:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,You be the judge，but one thing's for sure：
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.78,1:40:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,The folks at the Natural History Museum have really outdone them…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.75,1:40:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Any explanation at all？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.26,1:41:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。Got nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.09,1:41:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:02.93,1:41:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll take your keys and your flashlight.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:23.61,1:41:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Folks，this way.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.37,1:42:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,My name is Nick Daley。My career Day parent is my dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:27.55,1:42:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's the night watchman at the Museum of Natural History.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.72,1:42:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，how's it going？Well，Nicky said it：
Dialogue: 0,1:42:37.86,1:42:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm the night watchman at the Museum of Natural History.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:40.43,1:42:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me tell you something：That's when history comes alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.66,1:42:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,How many of you guys have been over to the museum？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.19,1:43:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Goal！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:39.48,1:43:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，it's getting late。Are you ready to go home？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:42.45,1:43:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:49.96,1:43:51.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's ride.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:29.05,1:44:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was nice of Larry not to rat us out，but this is ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:32.62,1:44:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,we're night watchmen，not janitors！
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.69,1:44:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gentlemen，you're doing a terrific job.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:37.79,1:44:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll gonna catch a few Z's.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:39.29,1:44:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,You ain't going nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:40.93,1:44:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Start mopping，hot dog.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:48.03,1:44:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.04,0:01:14.54,Title,0,0,0,0,,《博物馆奇妙夜》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.24,0:03:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂！小心点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.68,0:03:19.87,Note,0,0,0,0,,（故障 这招没用）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.89,0:03:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.93,0:03:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 麦克
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.80,0:03:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拉瑞 - 你好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.71,0:03:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.97,0:03:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他跟雅莉回去了 今天是职场家长日
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.71,0:03:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,只读半天
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.25,0:03:57.08,Note,0,0,0,0,,（职场家长日）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.75,0:04:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 嘿 进来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.45,0:04:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好吧？- 还好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.23,0:04:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么没人跟我说 今天是职场家长日？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.23,0:04:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？尼克说他会告诉你的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.80,0:04:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.53,0:04:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他来了 你好吗 拉瑞？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.04,0:04:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 你呢 唐恩？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.94,0:04:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.44,0:04:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说这天气够怪的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.48,0:04:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷冰冰 像冷冰冰的酷企鹅
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.45,0:04:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,别吵啦 我会跟小可爱说你来了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.92,0:04:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.76,0:04:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你未婚夫腰上挂的家伙可真多
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.10,0:04:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别闹了 - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.60,0:04:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？我是说 他就好像…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.77,0:04:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,股票市场的武林至尊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.54,0:04:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他是债券交易员 - 债券交易员 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.77,0:05:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的虚拟高球练习场进度如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.28,0:05:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,技术面还有待克服
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.45,0:05:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不简单 有很多移动的物品
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.95,0:05:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想尼克会喜欢皇后区吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.39,0:05:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 不 拉瑞 你不会又被赶出来了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.52,0:05:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.39,0:05:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,被赶出来 我没有 不 我是说…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.56,0:05:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 我还没有被赶出来 - 拉瑞 听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.80,0:05:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克不能再忍受这一切了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.80,0:05:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,每隔几个月就换新工作 新住所
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.60,0:05:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不是为了尼克 我不会管你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.04,0:05:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么不安定对他不好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.94,0:05:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在设法解决问题
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.32,0:05:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要知道
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.82,0:05:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不认为尼克该跟你在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.56,0:05:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 除非你安定下来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.09,0:05:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 爸
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.86,0:05:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 准备去冰上溜跶了？- 酷啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.84,0:06:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好耶 尼克 抄球盘！冲出去！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.61,0:06:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你搞什么啊？- 小乖 你还好吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.55,0:06:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧？- 我很好 你下去好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.85,0:06:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 他们的左卫很弱
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.46,0:06:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,往左去 你就有机会射门 好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.46,0:06:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢了 - 好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.36,0:06:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 我们很好 继续比赛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.37,0:06:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.20,0:06:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.94,0:06:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今天表现得超精彩
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.37,0:06:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,当职业选手绝对没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.04,0:06:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想打曲棍球了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.05,0:06:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 那你想做什么？- 债券交易员
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.52,0:06:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,债券交易员？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.92,0:06:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,唐恩就是做那个的 他带我去过他办公室
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.69,0:06:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.16,0:06:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想每天穿西装打领带？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.00,0:07:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,像个机器人？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.40,0:07:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,办公隔间里不能打球 太窘了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.10,0:07:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有一间很大的办公室
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.91,0:07:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是重点 你喜欢曲棍球的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.48,0:07:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是喜欢 但当交易员是我的退路
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.78,0:07:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的退路？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.71,0:07:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你还没大到要有退路
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.92,0:07:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你是从哪听到这字眼的？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.75,0:07:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈跟唐恩有谈过你的阴谋
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.99,0:07:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说是阴谋？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.53,0:07:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说你该找个退路了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.80,0:07:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的又要搬家了？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.20,0:07:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 再说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.64,0:07:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,皇后区有些地方挺酷的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.24,0:07:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 - 嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.01,0:07:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克 看着我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.08,0:07:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.55,0:07:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我最近状况很多
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.95,0:07:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你并不好过
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.12,0:08:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我觉得我就快成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.99,0:08:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,到那时 一切都会很顺利
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.16,0:08:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,万一你弄错了呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.60,0:08:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,万一你只是个 需要找份工作的普通人呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.47,0:08:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.18,0:08:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会搞清楚的 好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.48,0:08:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我们去找你妈吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.23,0:08:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,达理先生 我敢说 我从事这行43年
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.66,0:08:41.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,从未看过你这种履历
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.00,0:08:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.13,0:08:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那并不是赞美
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.10,0:08:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面写你当过执行长
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.11,0:08:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫「啪哒集团」
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.84,0:08:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,能说明一下吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.68,0:08:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 那是我发明的出品集团 啪哒弹指器
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.62,0:09:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,弹一下指头 灯就开 弹一下指头 灯就关
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.35,0:09:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是早就上市了？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.22,0:09:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 那是拍掌器 那很显然是…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.06,0:09:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,剽窃了我们的点子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.86,0:09:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我个人是看不出有什么差别
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.43,0:09:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 随便 不过
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.00,0:09:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过显然有占很多数比例的人口 这方面有点困难
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.47,0:09:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不大能够弹指头 - 拍掌比较简单
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.88,0:09:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这有待商确
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.88,0:09:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我帮不了你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.38,0:09:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,黛比？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.72,0:09:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能叫你黛比吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.12,0:09:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一进来就觉得你倍感亲切
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.12,0:09:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你对我也有同感
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.43,0:09:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你没感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.26,0:09:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.70,0:09:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明天就要有一份工作
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.60,0:09:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是找不到…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.17,0:09:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正我就是需要 好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.71,0:10:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.24,0:10:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能有个缺
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.95,0:10:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们回绝了我派去的每一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.42,0:10:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.25,0:10:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁知道呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.76,0:10:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能会走运
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.76,0:10:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 你好 - 你好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.56,0:10:56.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是拉瑞·戴利 我来找克西傅德瑞克面试
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.73,0:10:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他应该还在办公室里 - 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.00,0:11:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是导览员贝嘉贺门 - 你好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.64,0:11:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我带你过去吧 - 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.21,0:11:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰迪罗斯福总统 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.65,0:11:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 好眼力 - 当然
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.48,0:11:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是第四任总统 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.72,0:11:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是第二十六任 - 第二十六任
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.12,0:11:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,请勿触碰展品
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.26,0:11:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,下等人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.99,0:11:27.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,贺门小姐 我不能忍受这种混乱
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.20,0:11:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一间博物馆 不是…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.83,0:11:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道博物馆代表什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.64,0:11:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是代表 「哇 爸爸 好大的恐龙」
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.54,0:11:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我能碰他的脚吗？」 不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.51,0:11:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托你解决问题
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.51,0:11:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会的 - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.72,0:11:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦菲博士 博物馆总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.02,0:11:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来挺风趣的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.02,0:11:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托管一下你的小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.60,0:12:03.76,Note,0,0,0,0,,（警卫室）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.70,0:12:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁啊？开玩笑的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.07,0:12:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 我是拉瑞·戴利 你是傅德瑞克先生？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.88,0:12:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,傅德瑞克先生是我爸
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.21,0:12:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫克西 幸会 拉瑞 握手力道不错
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.72,0:12:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢 这代表一个人的个性 进来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.59,0:12:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就打开天窗说亮话吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.43,0:12:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,博物馆近年亏损连连
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.20,0:12:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜现在的孩子 不再喜欢蜡像或填充动物了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.07,0:12:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他们要缩编 就是裁撤…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.84,0:12:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和夜班警卫
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.18,0:12:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要找新的警卫来取代我们
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.44,0:12:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 - 你又能怎样呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.15,0:12:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,见见我两位同事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.89,0:12:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷纳？葛斯？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.59,0:13:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他人呢？我要亲手扁他
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.93,0:13:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛斯 这位是拉瑞·戴利 他要来当新的夜班警卫
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.23,0:13:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,夜班警卫？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.40,0:13:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,介绍所的人说是博物馆的职位
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.74,0:13:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,博物馆里最重要的职位
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.11,0:13:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他看来像个怪胎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.61,0:13:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好警卫 做人却很糟
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.18,0:13:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 呆瓜 别想耍花招
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.68,0:13:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟拳王对战过九回合
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.12,0:13:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才没跟拳王对战过
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.12,0:13:33.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,两位 这里有个应征者
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.79,0:13:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的履历很漂亮 态度又积极
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.49,0:13:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为该给他一个机会
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.13,0:13:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我要想一下
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.27,0:13:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底要不要工作 呆瓜？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.91,0:13:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要 我要这份工作 - 欢迎成为夜班警卫 拉瑞
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.74,0:13:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉瑞 到二楼等我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.98,0:13:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我穿上护膝带你走一圈 膝盖关节炎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.15,0:14:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,年纪大可不好玩 朋友 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.86,0:14:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真认为他可以？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.73,0:14:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.67,0:14:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可以的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.75,0:14:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跟上 我可是活动力很强的老人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.88,0:14:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是实景模型陈列区
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.22,0:14:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.69,0:14:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得这些小家伙 真可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.76,0:14:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,克西
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.50,0:14:54.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 克西
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.78,0:15:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我吓到你了吧？- 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.49,0:15:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你吓到我了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.06,0:15:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 别在这里干蠢事 这玩意很古老了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.46,0:15:26.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 你也看得出来 最近很冷清
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.87,0:15:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,左边是匈奴王阿提拉和匈奴人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.74,0:15:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是复活岛的巨石像
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.48,0:15:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.32,0:15:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是非洲哺乳动物陈列室
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.02,0:15:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.32,0:15:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,猴子 我喜欢猴子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.33,0:15:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 - 他真可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.26,0:15:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我们叫他德克斯特 他真是…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.14,0:16:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,可爱 对不对啊 德克斯特？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.51,0:16:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.41,0:16:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后 这是法老王阿卡曼拉之殿
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.52,0:16:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,下面那个石棺 法老王就躺里面
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.39,0:16:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.89,0:16:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他后方墙上挂的是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.29,0:16:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他最重视的宝贝 阿卡曼拉刻写板
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.03,0:16:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,24K纯金 价值连城
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.57,0:16:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,真酷
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.47,0:16:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.17,0:16:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,很酷
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.18,0:16:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天下午五点报到 我们会跟你说明你的职责
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.52,0:16:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,五点 我会到的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.55,0:16:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.92,0:16:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我 我找到工作了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.19,0:16:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是太好了 什么工作？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.70,0:17:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这工作…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.03,0:17:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,在自然历史博物馆里
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.47,0:17:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以告诉尼克我们不搬家了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.34,0:17:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是好消息
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.67,0:17:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 明天见了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.51,0:17:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 - 好 再见
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.32,0:17:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉瑞？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.19,0:17:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的钥匙 手电筒
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.03,0:17:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 - 把那些绑在腰带上
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.00,0:17:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里晚上会有点吓人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.43,0:17:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你可能会想开几盏灯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.87,0:17:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,手电筒 钥匙 还有什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.71,0:17:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,指令手册
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.71,0:17:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,手册
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.21,0:17:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,依顺序来 一 二 三
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.51,0:17:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,四？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.02,0:17:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在搞笑吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.98,0:17:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真该赏你一拳 臭小子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.05,0:18:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,别闹他了 葛斯 拉瑞 你行吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.22,0:18:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我行的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.53,0:18:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你最好是行 - 葛斯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.10,0:18:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,照顺序来 要彻底也要快
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.77,0:18:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 最重要的是要记得 别让任何东西进来或出去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.24,0:18:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.54,0:18:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运 孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.41,0:18:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 晚安 葛斯 - 臭小子 爱搞笑
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.48,0:18:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.05,0:18:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.78,0:19:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.78,0:19:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,检查
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.65,0:19:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,检查
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.52,0:19:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是拉瑞
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.29,0:19:14.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,检查 拉瑞 拉瑞…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.54,0:19:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,星期一！星期一！星期一！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.14,0:19:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,超级卡车大赛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.65,0:20:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,克西？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.39,0:20:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好笑 克西
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.90,0:20:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么 大卫魔术秀吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.94,0:21:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真怪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.92,0:21:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,克西？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.37,0:22:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊 旋转！旋转！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.49,0:22:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 姓名？- 克西
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.49,0:22:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 傅德瑞克 - 稍候 拨接中
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.03,0:22:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂 - 克西 我是拉瑞·戴利
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.26,0:22:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉瑞 有事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.50,0:22:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐龙活过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.24,0:22:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听不见
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.54,0:22:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,龙舌兰！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.01,0:22:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐龙活过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.01,0:22:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.58,0:22:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,看手册 手册里都有解释
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.75,0:22:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拿到了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.52,0:22:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 明天见 - 等等！什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.03,0:23:06.96,Note,0,0,0,0,,（一 丢骨头）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.13,0:23:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么骨头？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.59,0:24:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,捡骨头？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.89,0:24:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,玩捡骨头？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.72,0:24:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.53,0:24:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 笨笨 - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.37,0:24:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你给我糖糖 - 给你糖糖？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.44,0:24:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,新笨笨 给我糖糖
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.14,0:25:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗？我没有糖糖 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.44,0:25:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有我不叫笨笨 我叫拉瑞
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.48,0:25:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你叫笨笨
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.45,0:25:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你麻烦大了 笨笨
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.55,0:25:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好跑跑躲匈匈阿提拉
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.49,0:25:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,待会见了 笨笨
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.26,0:25:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.24,0:26:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.78,0:26:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.51,0:26:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.88,0:26:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.02,0:26:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎卡加味？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.35,0:26:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是莎卡加味？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.02,0:26:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎卡佳薇！你是莎卡佳薇？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.43,0:26:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,玻璃 我不能…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.26,0:27:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到你
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.03,0:27:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听不到？你听不到我？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.77,0:27:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 你帮助路易斯和克拉克…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.50,0:27:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是路易斯和克拉克？而你是…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.87,0:27:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好像… 我是拉瑞
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.78,0:27:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？你知道这是怎么回事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.45,0:27:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,匈奴人 我得要…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.92,0:28:03.82,Note,0,0,0,0,,（二 关好狮子 不然他们会吃了你）
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.00,0:28:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.00,0:28:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,大铜人 嗨 你好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.57,0:28:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我新来的 上面写我该关好狮子 不然他们会吃了我
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.71,0:28:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是伽利略？不是？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.36,0:28:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,观光客
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.00,0:28:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.47,0:28:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是新来的 我只想关门收工
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.87,0:28:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果可以的话 我就看我的书
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.88,0:28:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不再烦你们 好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.94,0:29:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,再检查一次你的腰带 猴子可能偷走钥匙了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.84,0:30:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,猴子
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.45,0:30:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 你叫什么名字？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.05,0:30:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 回来
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.45,0:30:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,德伊？那是你的名字吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.59,0:30:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对 德威？德克斯特
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.73,0:30:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,德克斯特 把钥匙给我吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.10,0:30:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想锁门
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.50,0:30:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 很好 过来找爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.80,0:30:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 能把那些钥匙给我吗？很好 真是个好孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.64,0:30:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.74,0:30:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 没关系 非常 非常感谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.63,0:30:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏猴子！快停！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.63,0:31:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是不对的 你尿完了？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.01,0:31:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对我有意见吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.74,0:31:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我就算对人有意见 我也不会乱洒尿
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.01,0:31:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 我告诉你 钥匙在此
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.28,0:31:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,德克斯特！这不好玩！快还来！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.75,0:31:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,德克斯特！快还来！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.62,0:31:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 我知道你在想什么 别那么做 那主意不好
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.03,0:31:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,德克斯特 我需要那些纸
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.30,0:31:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,别鼓励他 你以为你朋友觉得你很有趣？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.60,0:31:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 他是头头 你们是观众？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.84,0:31:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,别那么做
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.70,0:31:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.55,0:31:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.20,0:32:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.46,0:32:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.03,0:32:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我嘴唇麻了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.10,0:32:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.60,0:32:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.06,0:33:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.23,0:33:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.24,0:33:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他的腿绑起来
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.28,0:33:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 逮住他这个大猪头 - 你干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.51,0:33:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他绑好！这下大也没用了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.02,0:33:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.75,0:33:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,每晚 年复一年
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.52,0:33:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们其中一个警卫 把我们锁在这些箱子里
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.16,0:33:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我特此声明 先生…够了！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.07,0:33:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,发动火车头
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.41,0:33:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 金发男？- 我叫杰迪戴亚
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.25,0:33:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰迪戴亚 停住火车
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.41,0:34:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我无能为力 卧轨男 - 这是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.18,0:34:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有人得受到惩罚 - 为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.59,0:34:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 就是惩罚！别叫了 冷静接受惩罚吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.06,0:34:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 快停住火车
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.80,0:34:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 停住火车 - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.83,0:34:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在全速前进压烂他
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.07,0:34:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他的头压个稀巴烂
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.07,0:34:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.88,0:34:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是够了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.58,0:34:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,有状况！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.95,0:34:34.14,Note,0,0,0,0,,（巨人逃走了）
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.42,0:34:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我逮到他了 我逮到他了 我逮到他了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.16,0:34:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 老天 - 准备投石器
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.80,0:34:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥克塔维厄斯 等等 这不是你的战场 这巨人在我们的土地上
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.61,0:35:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,小家伙 小杰？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.21,0:35:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是巨人 好吗？我身材中等
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.31,0:35:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,别一副高高在上的样子！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.18,0:35:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是巨人 是你们太小了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.48,0:35:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也许小 心却很大
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.85,0:35:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是比喻性的说法
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.12,0:35:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是说你们是很迷你
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.63,0:35:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,安静！罗马帝国无所不知
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.63,0:35:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别那么做 孩子 - 怎么做？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.36,0:35:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 奥克塔维厄斯！- 别做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.93,0:35:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 展开攻击！- 不要
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.21,0:35:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,上来 孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.15,0:35:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,握紧我的手 孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.45,0:35:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,上马
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.42,0:35:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 快逃吧！听见没？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.46,0:35:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个八字胡男 他没办法永远保护你的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.90,0:36:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你 - 别客气
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.64,0:36:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,西奥多罗斯福 第26任
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.67,0:36:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国总统 为您效劳
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.47,0:36:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是拉瑞·戴利 新进夜班警卫
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.92,0:36:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸会 拉瑞达理 不过请恕我失礼
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.02,0:36:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,猎杀正在进行
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.36,0:36:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,进行猎杀
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.39,0:36:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,总统先生 我能问你一些事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.93,0:36:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可以 不过就一个问题 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.13,0:36:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？这是阿拉丁神灯吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.10,0:36:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是的 自己才是生存的关键
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.54,0:36:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,人要向自己的内心寻求解答 我能帮得上什么忙？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.91,0:36:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知该怎么说 请别误会
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.71,0:36:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过博物馆里的东西 不是应该…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.38,0:36:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一片死寂？- 死寂？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.12,0:36:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 - 跟我来
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.89,0:36:59.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,随你叫吧 法老王
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.56,0:37:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你待54年了 今晚出不去的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.90,0:37:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是一切混乱的根源
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.77,0:37:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿卡曼拉刻写板
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.71,0:37:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,1952年尼罗河探险后被送到此
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.41,0:37:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在当晚 博物馆里的一切都活了过来
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.42,0:37:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后每晚也都如此
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.42,0:37:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,博物馆里的一切每晚都复活？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.93,0:37:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.96,0:37:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我该做些什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.80,0:37:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是守夜者 拉瑞 这机构里最值得尊敬的职位
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.81,0:37:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 走吧 - 好了 这是不可能的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.18,0:37:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有不可能的事 梦想也能成真
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.94,0:37:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以巨大的胡狼神瞪着你 别看他
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.31,0:37:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的工作是确保大家待在博物馆
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.95,0:37:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,当太阳出来 要是有人在外面
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.65,0:38:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就会化为尘埃
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.29,0:38:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 尘埃？- 尘埃
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.83,0:38:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的？- 真的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.30,0:38:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,天快亮了 我帮你恢复秩序吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.47,0:38:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过这是我最后一次这么做 明白吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.27,0:38:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白 我想是吧 我想我不…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.71,0:38:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,别唠叨 明白还是不明白？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.04,0:38:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 明白 - 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.68,0:38:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们动身吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.99,0:38:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 爬虫动物厅很安全
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.04,0:38:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在找什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.01,0:38:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在…追踪
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.01,0:38:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个人必须要追踪 欢迎来到这个大家庭
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.25,0:39:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,明晚见了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.52,0:39:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 我怀疑我会再来
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.52,0:39:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？你才刚开始呢
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.85,0:39:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是我想要的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.52,0:39:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拉瑞？- 是
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.83,0:39:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你之前是做什么的？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.13,0:39:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多 我发明过「啪哒弹指器」
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.40,0:39:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也放弃发明了？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.17,0:39:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我只是碰上了一些障碍 你听说过「拍掌器」吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.57,0:39:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拉瑞？- 是 先生
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.04,0:39:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些英雄造时势 有些时势造英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.78,0:39:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你来说 这正是你的时机
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.64,0:40:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,妙啊！唬到你了 孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.11,0:40:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 你是唬到我了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.35,0:40:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你的小小朋友打招呼吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.09,0:40:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你干嘛？- 放我下来
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.39,0:40:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢被人抓着
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.72,0:40:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 冷静点 - 这感觉很不好
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.09,0:40:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让我觉得自己渺小又无力 - 说完没？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.87,0:40:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要射你的眼睛 射瞎你的狗眼
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.00,0:40:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续射啊 根本不会有事
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.61,0:40:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在知道我丢脸的地方了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.18,0:40:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰迪戴亚无能 他的枪没用
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.28,0:40:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没完呢 你等着瞧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.62,0:40:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想听了 好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.82,0:40:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,蹲下！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.12,0:40:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,个子越大 摔的越重
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.39,0:40:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这工作给的钟点费也太低了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.13,0:40:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,巨人好怕 有更大的东西在跑耶
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.27,0:41:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.21,0:41:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉瑞？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.71,0:41:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉瑞？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.48,0:41:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,别那样 我们年纪大不经吓
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.99,0:41:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你们喜欢惊喜 像你们给我的惊喜
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.16,0:41:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,像博物馆的东西晚上都会活过来
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.82,0:41:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是太有趣了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.83,0:42:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本不会相信我们的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.66,0:42:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们知道我昨晚怎么过的吗？- 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.90,0:42:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们知道我昨晚怎么过的吗？- 安静点 胆小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.00,0:42:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我不知道那是真的假的 但我没同意要参一脚
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.17,0:42:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是需要一份正常工作 没生命危险 又能应付开销
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.28,0:42:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以感谢你们 我把制服留在办公室里
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.18,0:42:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我把制服留在办公室 再见 - 拉瑞！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.42,0:42:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸？- 嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.06,0:42:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子 你来这干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.53,0:42:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,雅莉要去法院 所以我带大人物先生去学校
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.53,0:42:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想来看你的新工作
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.20,0:42:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里工作真棒
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.07,0:42:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,小家伙 要不要进去看看？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.74,0:42:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你爸会给你贵宾级的导览
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.88,0:42:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 我们今天早上很忙
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.48,0:42:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过尼克 我保证 我很快就带你来参观 好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.22,0:42:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 - 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.02,0:43:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拜 爸爸 - 拜
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.22,0:43:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我爱你 - 我也爱你 小乖
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.02,0:43:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 好
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.75,0:43:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉瑞
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.52,0:43:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就再试一个晚上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.26,0:43:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很高兴 欢迎回来
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.33,0:43:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你！晚班警卫 马上过来
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.31,0:43:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？- 「怎么了？」
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.98,0:43:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我走 我带你去看 「怎么了先生」
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.78,0:43:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,来
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.62,0:44:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻烦你解释这是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.09,0:44:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 这个嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.73,0:44:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也只是猜想啦 不过我想 罗马人太狂妄
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.56,0:44:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑进大西部
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.57,0:44:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,牛仔知道罗马人想夺取他的地盘
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.87,0:44:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以就把他架上示众台
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.51,0:44:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,笑吧 搞笑夜班警卫
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.31,0:44:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,答案是不对
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.95,0:44:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这是挖苦你的烂幽默感
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.32,0:44:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没笑
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.62,0:44:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是假笑 如果那是你想要的 你想比幽默
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.89,0:44:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.86,0:44:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.03,0:44:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并不想比幽默
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.83,0:44:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 因为那样你会一败涂地
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.33,0:44:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,大角山战役并不好笑
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.04,0:45:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为那跟追星族一样可笑
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.98,0:45:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不好笑 好吗？我不会容许这么过份的…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.48,0:45:12.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我没说清楚 告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.42,0:45:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说清楚了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.66,0:45:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 - 是？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.56,0:45:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,克西？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.17,0:45:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那本指令手册你有备份吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.10,0:45:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕没有 我告诉你该怎么做吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.37,0:45:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,去看一些书 重温历史
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.11,0:45:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚来时 那对我助益很大
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.01,0:45:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这间博物馆是献给那个骑马的人
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.02,0:45:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,西奥多罗斯福
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.72,0:45:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他喜爱历史 也相信人越明了过去
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.96,0:45:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,就更能准备好迎接未来
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.39,0:45:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 谁能告诉我这间是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.13,0:45:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 非洲哺乳动物陈列室
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.70,0:46:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是丛林之王 狮子
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.14,0:46:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面是我最喜欢的动物之一 僧帽猴
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.41,0:46:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,一种具有高度智慧的灵长类 以其仁慈慷慨的天性闻名
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.42,0:46:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.92,0:46:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是觉得…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.99,0:46:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是有同感的笑出来
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.93,0:46:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,快乐的猴子
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.46,0:46:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 孩子们 往这边来
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.50,0:46:38.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你 我才不买帐
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.81,0:46:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你骗的了小孩 骗不了我 你骗不倒我的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.48,0:46:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,等着瞧吧 好戏即将登场
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.05,0:46:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好戏即将登场
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.52,0:46:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,历史上最有名的追踪者之一 莎卡佳薇
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.92,0:46:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,她引领路易斯和克拉克 找到太平洋
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.36,0:47:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们也许听过这句话 「坐而言不如起而行」
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.79,0:47:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们写…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.00,0:47:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 达理先生？- 她是聋子吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.00,0:47:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,聋？不 她不是
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.84,0:47:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为她看来有点… 没反应
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.48,0:47:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是因为她是一尊雕像
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.28,0:47:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我一下 去看看她吧 她很酷的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.09,0:47:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你这是干嘛？- 既然我每晚都要待在这
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.76,0:47:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想认识我所守卫的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.96,0:47:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 我有一堆问题
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.06,0:47:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你休息 我能请你喝咖啡吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.93,0:47:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝咖啡？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.43,0:47:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 纯粹是同事对同事
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.00,0:47:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,资讯交流那类的咖啡
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.44,0:47:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,过二十分钟再见
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.61,0:47:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你 - 不客气
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.28,0:47:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 希望你有个好的…- 好了 孩子们
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.01,0:47:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.85,0:47:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,她引领这些人跋山涉水
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.22,0:48:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,她身上还背着孩子 她是终极的职业母亲
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.02,0:48:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是莎卡假薇专家
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.53,0:48:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是莎卡佳薇 - 莎卡佳薇？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.03,0:48:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是自然的 我这篇论文准备了四年
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.13,0:48:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,四年写一篇论文？是我铁定会抓狂
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.24,0:48:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实那比较像是一本九百页的书
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.94,0:48:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢？你从小就立志当警卫？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.75,0:48:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不是故意…- 不 不 不
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.12,0:48:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我离婚了 还有个十岁大的儿子
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.12,0:48:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要更稳定一点的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.09,0:48:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂了 你想知道馆里什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.29,0:48:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,匈奴王阿提拉 他是怎么搞的？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.56,0:48:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是唯一威胁过罗马帝国的人
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.17,0:48:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,人称「恐怖魔王」
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.17,0:48:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿提拉和他的手下 常将无助的受害者五马分尸
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.81,0:48:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他以迷信著称
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.31,0:49:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,身旁围绕着巫师和术士
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.58,0:49:06.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们以黑魔法迷惑指使他
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.13,0:49:17.12,Note,0,0,0,0,,（复活岛）
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.90,0:49:22.89,Note,0,0,0,0,,（大西部驿马车）
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.78,0:49:30.77,Note,0,0,0,0,,（罗马战争策略）
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.47,0:50:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉瑞？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.27,0:50:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想祝你好运
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.18,0:50:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有再见 这是我们最后一晚
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.88,0:50:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了波卡 来找我们
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.65,0:50:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要出城？万一这一切不顺利呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.02,0:50:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这么聪明 一定没问题的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.72,0:50:18.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,打个电话就能找到我们 送我们出去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.43,0:50:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们先走
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.50,0:50:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要独处一下
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.33,0:50:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很感伤 这房里有许多回忆
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.23,0:51:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好玩吧 大个子
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.57,0:51:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.37,0:51:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,找火？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.84,0:51:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞定 自己找乐子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.88,0:51:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安 笨笨
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.38,0:51:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不笨笨 你笨笨 你有糖糖吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.25,0:51:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,有 大头呆 很多糖糖
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.10,0:52:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？我听不见 玻璃挡住了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.14,0:52:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.35,0:52:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,用力拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.62,0:52:25.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,用力拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.62,0:52:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.35,0:52:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不扩张 就得死
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.99,0:52:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,用力拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.33,0:52:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 用力！- 数到三
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.13,0:52:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,就炸翻这个蚁丘
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.03,0:52:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一个 两个 - 杰迪戴亚 住手
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.64,0:52:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 你炸山 只是在炸墙
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.64,0:52:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,别管闲事 巨怪 我们要建铁道 要炸山洞
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.14,0:52:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一 别再叫我什么巨怪了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.65,0:52:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我只想停止这一切 - 我们就是要炸
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.85,0:53:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 碰 了不起 你干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.76,0:53:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这像干嘛？这是天命
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.06,0:53:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你无法与之抗衡 我也一样 再多用点火药
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.16,0:53:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 全用了 - 好啊 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.70,0:53:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 屋大尾？你得停止那样
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.54,0:53:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫奥克塔维厄斯 赖皮
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.67,0:53:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 来 事情就会变成这样
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.48,0:53:24.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不能这样 我是罗马将军 - 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.88,0:53:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我有权利 - 还有你
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.31,0:53:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 不 放我下来 - 继续攻
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.98,0:53:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会回来的 我发誓
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.45,0:53:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要谈一谈
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.39,0:53:35.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过我不喜欢被人抓着
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.99,0:53:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我要抓着你
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.76,0:53:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们到底是怎样？为什么老处不来？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.56,0:53:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是男人 我们战斗 就这样
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.06,0:53:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都这样杀时间
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.90,0:53:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是巨人 怪胎 你没办法了解的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.37,0:53:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,空间很大 你们不用腻在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.71,0:53:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？你是说 - 你要让我们出去？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.88,0:54:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,四处闲逛？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.98,0:54:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,有可能 只要你们保证不乱来
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.72,0:54:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那表示没火花 没爆炸
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.02,0:54:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我敢起誓 主人
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.42,0:54:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 没问题 巨怪
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.26,0:54:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 我的名字叫拉瑞 阿嘉
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.33,0:54:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫你阿嘉 不叫你小人
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.23,0:54:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.97,0:54:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小鬼头 如何？- 我不喜欢 我很受伤
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.74,0:54:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,「巨怪」也让我觉得像怪胎
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.64,0:54:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会那样 我就叫你拉瑞
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.28,0:54:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,少谄媚了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.45,0:54:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在信任你们
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.45,0:54:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要是不听我的话 就会跟小马雅人一样
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.09,0:54:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,被关起来 你们看
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.32,0:54:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们看来高兴吗？- 不
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.76,0:54:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们看来很难过
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.30,0:54:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他们不能为所欲为
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.53,0:54:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我给你们一点自由 别让我失望
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.94,0:55:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得走了 好好相处 好吗？好 谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.84,0:55:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,笨笨 糖糖好吃吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.28,0:55:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.98,0:55:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,德克斯特 我要锁了 要进来吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.45,0:55:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.66,0:55:18.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.30,0:55:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？你拿了我的钥匙？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.80,0:55:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不这么想
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.07,0:55:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来老拉瑞骗过小德克斯特了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.81,0:55:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是给小宝宝玩的玩具钥匙
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.91,0:55:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好玩吧 小猴子
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.31,0:55:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许明天我会带纸尿布给你 你可以拿来便便
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.88,0:55:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会搔搔你的痒 因为你是可爱的小猴子
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.39,0:55:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉瑞叔叔骗你 你要哭整晚吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.66,0:55:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过好戏即将登场
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.17,0:56:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 泰迪 - 拉瑞
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.50,0:56:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个没礼貌的小子 我就知道你会回来
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.34,0:56:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你看来身负重任 - 我准备再试一次
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.92,0:56:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你 - 什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.69,0:56:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在打量她？- 真敢说
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.19,0:56:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,打量 我没听过这种说法
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.33,0:56:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我是说 她很美
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.43,0:56:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 美？- 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.24,0:56:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我认为是个俊俏的女人 - 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.27,0:56:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你该去跟她说个话
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.01,0:56:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊！- 祝福你 小子
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.78,0:56:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 继续加油吧 - 好 再见
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.99,0:57:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.48,0:57:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.85,0:58:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 没关系 没关系 你们会说英文吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.85,0:58:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.85,0:58:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我不知道那是什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.66,0:58:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我知道我们一开始就没搞好 但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.66,0:58:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,有只小鸟告诉我 有人喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.17,0:58:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.57,0:58:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 魔法？- 魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.37,0:58:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,巫术
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.37,0:58:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,巫术
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.91,0:58:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 幻术
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.68,0:58:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都喜欢魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.38,0:58:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有花 人们都喜欢花
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.48,0:58:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些是给你的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.19,0:58:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们还喜欢什么？钱
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.92,0:58:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,无所不能的金钱 但金钱有时候会…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.19,0:58:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不见
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.40,0:58:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少我是这么…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.07,0:58:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.90,0:59:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,难怪你不懂我的话 你耳里有钱
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.04,0:59:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看 有人需要手帕吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.05,0:59:11.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不建议拿这条小手帕 因为这顽皮的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.15,0:59:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,会凭空
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.42,0:59:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,消失
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.23,0:59:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 那会穿帮…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.45,0:59:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,别五马分尸 各位 拜托 别五马分尸
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.27,1:00:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,蔻蒂兹 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.12,1:00:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.79,1:00:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,想都别想
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.53,1:00:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,德克斯特
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.50,1:00:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托你们
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.40,1:01:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 你们
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.17,1:01:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 两位…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.78,1:01:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.88,1:01:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在干嘛？我们不是讲好了？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.38,1:01:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们永远无法忍受这些小丑
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.78,1:01:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,承诺已成过去 小赖
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.88,1:01:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,该让手上的家伙说话了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.12,1:01:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那玩意根本没用
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.59,1:01:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？你看着
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.06,1:01:34.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,德克斯特！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.61,1:02:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.75,1:02:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,德克斯特
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.40,1:02:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你无路可逃了 小毛猴
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.03,1:02:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,无路可逃
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.82,1:03:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不是闹着玩的
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.82,1:03:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,快给我
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.70,1:03:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心 很好 德克斯特
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.13,1:03:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢慢来 就是这样
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.49,1:03:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天 你干嘛打猴子？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.66,1:03:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙一直惹我 我受够了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.16,1:03:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡说 这小家伙是你的远亲
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.37,1:03:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有他 就没有我们
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.70,1:03:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得了狂犬病啦？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.21,1:03:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,把泡泡擦干净
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.57,1:04:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得对这小家伙展现爱和尊重
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.38,1:04:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友 可以把钥匙给我吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.68,1:04:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 拉瑞？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.18,1:04:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道么
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.55,1:04:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你似乎很清楚该怎么做 所以我就让你接手
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.89,1:04:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能现在就举白旗
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.06,1:04:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,博物馆正濒临无政府状态
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.23,1:04:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我试过了 我今晚回来了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.13,1:04:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,就一晚 我也建不好巴拿马运河
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.70,1:04:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 但这是史上最荒谬的工作
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.04,1:04:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些英雄造时势
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.77,1:04:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 我知道 泰迪 有些时势造英雄
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.47,1:04:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你昨晚就说过那句话了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.48,1:04:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过不是每个人都是英雄
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.18,1:04:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些人只是普通人
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.98,1:04:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是 别再顾影自怜了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.79,1:04:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个伟大的旅程 都是由第一步开始
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.65,1:04:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你能教导居民和平相处 他们就不用被关起来了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.09,1:04:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,夜复一夜的 这话出自花五十年偷看女人
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.43,1:04:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,却不敢开口的人口中 还真有用
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.43,1:04:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来要去跟她说话的 拜托
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.23,1:05:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我受够了 好吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.44,1:05:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 笨龙
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.27,1:05:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.67,1:06:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.58,1:07:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人会再来这了 何况我二年级就来过了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.55,1:07:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸会给我们私人导览的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.26,1:07:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 达理先生？- 是
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.03,1:07:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 泡沫 - 是啊 我知道
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.13,1:07:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,在尼安德塔人展示区里！
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.60,1:07:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天晚上 灭火器出了点状况
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.73,1:07:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正要去清理
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.54,1:07:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用麻烦 你被炒了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.91,1:07:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天没得参观了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.18,1:07:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸刚被炒了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.71,1:07:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.12,1:07:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦菲先生？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.58,1:07:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 麦菲先生？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.19,1:07:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能跟你谈一谈吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.69,1:07:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 先生？- 干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.99,1:07:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我错了 但我现在知道该怎么做了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.06,1:07:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你显然是不知道 - 我本来不知 但现在知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.43,1:07:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的 麦菲先生 - 博士
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.93,1:07:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦菲博士
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.67,1:07:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能再给我一个晚上吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.31,1:07:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就再一晚 - 好 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.68,1:08:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你当班之后
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.25,1:08:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,有任何事发生
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.95,1:08:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.26,1:08:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我明白 - 好吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.12,1:08:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,骗我一次 是我丢脸 骗我两次
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.03,1:08:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我丢脸…我丢脸
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.17,1:08:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你 - 骗我两次 我明白
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.07,1:08:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 接不接受随你 - 好 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.48,1:08:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.78,1:08:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？- 也许你该去问尼克
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.49,1:08:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子 怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.79,1:08:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被炒了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.79,1:08:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？我并没有被炒啊
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.36,1:08:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我今早去了博物馆 你老板对你大吼
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.13,1:08:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么没告诉我？一切都没事
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.27,1:08:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 我们只是有点误会
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.24,1:09:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.01,1:09:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,很难解释 我是说 你不会相信…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.28,1:09:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样吧 我就让你见识一下
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.68,1:09:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 见识什么？- 跟我一起去上班
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.12,1:09:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉瑞？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.62,1:09:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能跟你谈一谈吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.53,1:09:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有麻烦吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.03,1:09:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉瑞 你在干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.90,1:09:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想让他看看我的工作
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.40,1:09:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很高兴你想和他分享 可是
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.60,1:09:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不认为尼克能再次承受失望
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.54,1:09:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会失望的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.84,1:09:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉瑞
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.71,1:09:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会失望的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.82,1:09:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,在警卫室等到大家离开
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.56,1:09:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 之后我就会来找你 好吗？- 好
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.61,1:10:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,小姐？我得请你离开本馆
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.98,1:10:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.95,1:10:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很棒的沉思之地 - 是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.22,1:10:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚没约会啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.89,1:10:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不大喜欢约会
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.09,1:10:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢跟已死之人相处
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.10,1:10:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,活人令我困惑
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.80,1:10:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,但说真的 你得走了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.27,1:10:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 认真的？- 抱歉 博物馆的规定
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.07,1:10:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要把一切都锁起来
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.87,1:10:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很认真执行你的工作
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.24,1:10:47.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一戴上领带 就很认真
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.81,1:10:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我明白了 - 好
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.18,1:10:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,论文进度如何？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.39,1:10:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我遇上瓶颈了 研究只能让我到此为止
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.86,1:10:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永远不会认识真正的她
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.42,1:11:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我该研究别的主题了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.20,1:11:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就让你继续工作吧
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.63,1:11:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 晚安 拉瑞 - 好…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.34,1:11:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.28,1:11:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.28,1:11:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝嘉
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.45,1:11:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 贝嘉 - 嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.86,1:11:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不认为你该放弃你的论文
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.29,1:11:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 为什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.26,1:11:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这听起来可能有点疯狂
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.20,1:11:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来真的很疯狂
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.97,1:11:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 我是说超疯狂的疯狂
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.84,1:11:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我能接受 - 好
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.47,1:11:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道在某些博物馆里 历史会栩栩如生
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.38,1:11:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 - 在这间博物馆里
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.18,1:11:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切真的活了过来
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.45,1:11:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在胡说什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.56,1:12:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这馆内的一切在晚上都会活过来
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.50,1:12:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的？- 是真的 我没骗你
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.80,1:12:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道阿卡曼拉刻写板吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.20,1:12:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,它让一切活过来
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.24,1:12:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,自它来了以后 一切都活了过来
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.21,1:12:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰迪罗斯福跟我说的 真的！那只猴子 德克斯特？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.41,1:12:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他是什么来着？- 僧帽猴
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.05,1:12:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,僧帽猴 他咬了我的鼻子 还在我身上撒了尿
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.29,1:12:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎卡佳薇在柜子里 每晚都复活
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.39,1:12:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,聆听路易斯和克拉克吵嘴
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.76,1:12:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你要是想了解她
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.60,1:12:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能帮你安排
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.00,1:12:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是太棒了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.43,1:12:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 是很棒 棒呆了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.94,1:12:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘲笑历史学者
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.84,1:13:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是的 贝嘉 - 晚安 拉瑞
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.75,1:13:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是在嘲笑你 贝嘉？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.53,1:13:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 馆内的最佳座位 - 怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.17,1:13:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,用说的你不会信 我让你自己看
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.90,1:13:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 你再过20秒就会看到了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.61,1:13:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你喜欢暴龙吧？- 喜欢
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.77,1:13:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫他小龙
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.24,1:13:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就快活过来了 儿子 再过
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.12,1:13:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,五 四 三 二
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.26,1:13:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸？- 等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.96,1:13:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟小龙打声招呼吧
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.47,1:13:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸 你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.97,1:14:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.64,1:14:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家出来啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.31,1:14:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳下山了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.28,1:14:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,总统 起床了 我要你醒来
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.98,1:14:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我儿子来了 醒醒啊
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.15,1:14:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,德克萨斯？快点 快跑啊
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.62,1:14:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑 德克萨斯
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.53,1:14:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,别闹了 好吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.83,1:14:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克 我告诉你 那里有个板子
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.50,1:14:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿卡曼拉刻写板
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.73,1:14:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这下又有个板子了？- 是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.57,1:14:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 爸
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.57,1:14:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.71,1:14:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它不见了 - 什么不见了？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.81,1:14:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,板子 我想有人偷走了它
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.65,1:14:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.65,1:14:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是开玩笑的 儿子
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.03,1:14:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.30,1:14:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 尼克
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.70,1:15:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 尼克 你要去哪？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.64,1:15:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 回家 - 等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.04,1:15:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.55,1:15:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不该在这里的
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.06,1:15:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,把板子给我们
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.36,1:15:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 尼克 你们在干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.56,1:15:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会伤害你 把板子给我们
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.93,1:15:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉告诉你这一切 孩子 不过你爸不在这工作
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.07,1:15:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被炒了 无法胜任
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.30,1:15:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸？你说过你没被炒的
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.40,1:15:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们骗人 这样他们才能偷东西
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.94,1:15:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,把中间那块翻过来 你就明白了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.78,1:15:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是博物馆的财产 孩子 拿给我
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.81,1:15:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克 相信我 快翻
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.95,1:15:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把板子给我们 - 尼克？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.78,1:15:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.64,1:16:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克？快跑
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.28,1:16:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我回来 小鬼
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.88,1:16:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏主意 拉瑞
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.98,1:16:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,想打架吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.69,1:16:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛斯 你是老人 我不想伤你
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.16,1:16:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉瑞 担任这工作几年下来 我们就明白
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.13,1:16:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就像博物馆里的一切 夜里会有新生命
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.37,1:16:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,日落到日出 我们都重获新生
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.84,1:16:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没想到有那招
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.64,1:16:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们重获活力
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.37,1:16:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们喜欢夜生活 拉瑞
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.81,1:16:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以一等他们辞退我们
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.15,1:16:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就得偷走板子
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.78,1:16:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都知道你需要钱
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.98,1:16:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,栽赃在你家的赃物
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.02,1:17:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚好成了你的罪证
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.32,1:17:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好照料伤口
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.39,1:17:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去找那个小鬼吧
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.33,1:17:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 祝你好梦 呆头 - 不！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.53,1:17:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,岩石落下技！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.80,1:17:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去拿板子吧
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.49,1:17:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 我们就从这里接手
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.03,1:17:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.57,1:17:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚好 我们正要锁门呢
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.87,1:17:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好睡吧
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.77,1:17:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去拿值钱的东西吧
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.84,1:18:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打算要过一段好日子
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.22,1:18:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰迪！你在的话 我需要你
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.13,1:18:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人叫我吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.23,1:18:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,西奥多罗斯福 为您效命
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.73,1:18:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰迪 你能带我们出去吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.77,1:18:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,做不到 这是你人生的机会
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.24,1:18:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托你少开讲了 我不是你
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.91,1:18:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没建巴拿马运河 也不是总统
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.54,1:18:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要帮忙
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.91,1:18:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.75,1:18:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些事也不是我做的 是泰迪罗斯福做的
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.85,1:18:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是模型工厂的产品
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.89,1:18:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从未射杀过野兽
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.92,1:18:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也没勇气告诉那位女士我爱她
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.63,1:18:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.76,1:18:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这次得完成这个工作 你不能放弃
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.07,1:18:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是蜡做的 拉瑞
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.77,1:19:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又是什么做的？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.41,1:19:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等等 那就是你的忠告？- 没错
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.09,1:19:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就对了 来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.93,1:19:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,低头！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.93,1:19:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.32,1:19:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 你好吗？抱歉打扰你了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.32,1:19:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 你的卫兵 你的胡狼神…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.53,1:19:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能不能请他们退下？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.00,1:20:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不想伤你 但他们不这么想 拜托你快点！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.04,1:20:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 尼克
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.38,1:20:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.58,1:20:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.43,1:20:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会相信这里面有多闷
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.94,1:20:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么会说英文？- 我上过剑桥
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.14,1:20:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你上过剑桥？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.41,1:20:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在埃及古物学系作过展示
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.14,1:20:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是阿卡曼拉 第四王朝的第四任国王
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.88,1:20:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲王国的统治者
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.02,1:20:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是拉瑞
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.65,1:20:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,密尔顿之子
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.65,1:20:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我儿 尼克
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.19,1:21:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来自布鲁克林
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.03,1:21:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,就我啦 他每周三和…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.46,1:21:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,隔周周末跟我住
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.40,1:21:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,监护权的协议
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.17,1:21:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉瑞 尼克 布鲁克林守护者
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.04,1:21:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永远感谢你们
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.08,1:21:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在请将刻写板给我
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.91,1:21:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好让我重掌我的王国
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.22,1:21:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 刻写板 我很乐意
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.42,1:21:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,将它返回给你 可是它不在
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.26,1:21:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们手上
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.73,1:21:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了 我会保护他的
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.67,1:21:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.05,1:22:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.12,1:22:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,匈奴人
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.76,1:22:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得解决这个家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.26,1:22:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 拉瑞 我会说匈奴话
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.51,1:22:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想把你五马分尸
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.51,1:22:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,又要分尸 我明白
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.21,1:23:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂了 你想撕扯什么
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.88,1:23:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是因为很久以前 有人撕扯了你
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.32,1:23:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.52,1:23:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久以前
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.86,1:23:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人伤了小阿提拉 就在这里
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.03,1:23:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们摧毁了某个东西 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.17,1:23:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们摧毁了爱
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.64,1:23:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你失去了爱
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.84,1:23:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,小宝宝孤单待在帐棚里
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.14,1:23:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸出门去
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.31,1:23:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,去掠夺某个城镇 或者
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.55,1:23:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,去抢某个地方 做他该做的事
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.35,1:23:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是谁被扔在家里？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.86,1:23:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.87,1:23:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,别压抑 释放出来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.22,1:24:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了 没事了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.46,1:24:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是下一个
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.60,1:24:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 深呼吸
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.41,1:24:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拉瑞·戴利 - 在
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.41,1:24:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.85,1:24:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 很好 很好
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.62,1:24:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 大家听着
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.13,1:24:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 听我说
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.36,1:25:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,安静！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.45,1:25:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的笨笨有话要说
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.22,1:25:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.88,1:25:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位是阿卡曼拉王
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.39,1:25:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的板子让各位每晚重获新生
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.39,1:25:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些夜班老警卫偷走了它
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.66,1:25:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,在天亮之前
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.43,1:25:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得找到这些警卫 拿回板子
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.50,1:25:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,南北战争士兵！快去天文馆
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.84,1:25:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不记得我探险家朋友的名字了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.84,1:25:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是哥伦布 - 哥伦布！对 真抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.38,1:25:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又没挂名牌 哥伦布 带尼安德塔人去搜索
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.35,1:25:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,无脊椎和爬虫类动物陈列室
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.45,1:25:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰迪戴亚和奥克塔维厄斯 他们的货车在后面 看住它
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.69,1:25:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 我不跟穿袍子的人合作
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.89,1:25:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗马人单打独斗
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.32,1:26:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那又不会痛 少孩子气了 - 会痛啦！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.69,1:26:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,少蠢了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.43,1:26:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那一下比较用力
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.26,1:26:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,两位 拜托
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.57,1:26:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿嘉 奥克塔维厄斯
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.84,1:26:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的年代虽然差了两千年
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.30,1:26:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你们并没有那么大的差异
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.41,1:26:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都是伟大的领袖
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.78,1:26:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都为自己的人民谋福利 对吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.21,1:26:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 - 对
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.75,1:26:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,南北战争的兵士们
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.02,1:26:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 你们是同胞 别再打斗了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.22,1:26:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,北方赢了 奴隶不对 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.73,1:26:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并不想毁了你们的幻想 不过南方 你们有艾曼兄弟
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.00,1:26:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有房车赛 别激动了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.30,1:26:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 没有了刻写板 这一切
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.74,1:26:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,夜生活就会划下休止符
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.61,1:26:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想那样 但我需要你们帮忙
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.88,1:26:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们做得到 但我们得齐心合力
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.38,1:27:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁要帮我？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.99,1:27:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.82,1:27:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁跟我同一阵线？- 好耶！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.92,1:27:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好啊 - 冲啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.83,1:27:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好耶 我们动手吧
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.83,1:27:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有动物们
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.00,1:27:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有无脸男们 一起来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.76,1:27:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来 各位
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.87,1:27:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉拉尼莫！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.28,1:28:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.20,1:28:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 要来软的还是硬的
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.80,1:28:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你们是想来硬的
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.94,1:28:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就快到了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.07,1:28:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救你自己吧
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.44,1:29:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想戒掉你
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.31,1:29:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛斯？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.21,1:29:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷纳？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.81,1:29:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,两位？你们在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.95,1:29:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟们？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.06,1:29:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就说嘛 干的好！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.73,1:29:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,团队合作太棒了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.29,1:29:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们消失了 要怎么找他们？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.76,1:29:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道有人能帮忙 来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.89,1:29:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.40,1:30:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎卡佳尾 或佳薇 有人偷了他的板子
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.44,1:30:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能追踪拿走它的人吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.61,1:30:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他往东走 不过失控撞车了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.38,1:30:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,真厉害 你怎么知道的？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.56,1:30:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他放弃车子
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.79,1:30:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑回去了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.79,1:30:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑回去？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.86,1:30:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为什么要回去？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.03,1:30:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.64,1:30:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救了我
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.58,1:30:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你值得我救 亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.05,1:30:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这下有问题了 - 泰迪 老天
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.85,1:30:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉瑞 别紧张 我是蜡做的
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.32,1:30:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过快天亮了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.32,1:31:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 馆里大半的东西都在外面乱跑 - 他拿了我的板子
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.33,1:31:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 小屋
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.37,1:31:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,为您效劳 巨怪
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.44,1:31:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人 我们该怎么帮忙？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.84,1:31:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我想一下
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.15,1:31:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,小龙？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.22,1:31:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 小乖
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.65,1:31:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰迪 我需要一匹马
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.06,1:31:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.84,1:31:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来啊 让我听你吼吧！- 嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.58,1:31:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真是梦想成真
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.61,1:31:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱死这一切了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.85,1:32:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,快停住马车 现在！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.92,1:32:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个弯能交给我吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.59,1:32:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就当是答应了 坐稳了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.10,1:32:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我控制不了它
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.45,1:32:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 我们了结这一切吧
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.62,1:32:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.99,1:32:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,把板子给我
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.89,1:32:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,做不到
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.87,1:32:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.50,1:32:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是不可能的 走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.34,1:32:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,快停住 不然我就动手了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.27,1:32:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们停不住的
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.31,1:32:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你历史没学好吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.15,1:33:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是载运钱财的 他们只听一个秘密指令
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.35,1:33:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗？你是说像…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.65,1:33:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,达科塔！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.96,1:33:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去 德克萨斯
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.50,1:33:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我温习过历史了 感谢指点
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.27,1:33:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.67,1:33:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,别在我儿子面前那样对我说话我
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.44,1:33:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.21,1:33:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 匈奴人 - 叫阿提拉让他的手下
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.32,1:33:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他跟其他警卫绑在一起
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.49,1:33:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 别五马分尸了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.04,1:34:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 别急 不要那么激动
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.87,1:34:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,「马基卡卡」啥意思？翻译一下 拜托
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.85,1:34:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是在1909年 我沿尚比西河而上
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.85,1:34:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的矮黑人向导用喀嗒声说话
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.96,1:34:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.03,1:34:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 老天 - 怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.13,1:34:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得把你们弄回博物馆
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.94,1:34:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么弄？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.94,1:34:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿卡曼拉 我需要你帮忙
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.51,1:34:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你懂板上的文字 你送大家回去
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.91,1:35:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个人得看看这个
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.18,1:35:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们每季付A-Rod这么多钱
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.62,1:35:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他每季都该打赢世界大赛
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.42,1:35:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你懂我的意思吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.51,1:35:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁来帮它们清大便啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.24,1:35:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伊努特人 - 在
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.61,1:35:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个陶土士兵
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.48,1:35:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 维京海盗 - 在
Dialogue: 0,1:35:50.95,1:35:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 羊鸵 - 欢迎回来 女士们
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.05,1:35:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 骆马 - 嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.82,1:35:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,维京海盗
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.32,1:35:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在化石森林古迹
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.96,1:36:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞了个火葬之类的东西 去清干净
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.26,1:36:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗？谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.06,1:36:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他回来了 - 我来处理这烦人的家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.97,1:36:10.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,大糜鹿 你过不来的
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.20,1:36:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你头上的角会卡住
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.80,1:36:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,带着你的驯鹿朋友去上货区
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.01,1:36:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拉瑞 - 泰迪
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.48,1:36:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,真高兴看到完整的你
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.21,1:36:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎卡佳薇弄点热腊就黏好了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.78,1:36:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉瑞？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.99,1:36:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过我不是跟你开玩笑
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.49,1:36:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道 - 泰迪？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.63,1:36:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.63,1:36:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想见见她吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.10,1:36:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 想 - 好
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.50,1:36:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.81,1:36:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗斯福总统 这是我朋友贝嘉
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.18,1:36:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 幸会 - 你好
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.01,1:36:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位是莎卡佳歪
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.31,1:36:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 薇 - 薇
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.38,1:36:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,薇
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.05,1:36:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,她有一些问题想问你
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.75,1:37:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你超赞的 我是你的超级粉丝
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.52,1:37:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想知道什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.89,1:37:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道该从何问起
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.11,1:37:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 达摩祖师 合十答礼 - 到
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.18,1:37:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,两匹斑马
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.21,1:37:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 到 - 德克斯特 欢迎回来
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.85,1:37:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,德克斯特 我们和好吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.06,1:37:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拉瑞 - 你看到了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.79,1:37:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你看到他打我了 - 谁比较高等？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.23,1:37:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我 - 谁比较高等？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.19,1:37:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.60,1:37:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.73,1:37:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,全员到齐
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.40,1:37:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好 大家都回来了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.07,1:37:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 不过…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.94,1:37:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有全部
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.84,1:37:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们今晚失去了几个好小子
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.34,1:38:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,伟大的胜利总是会有些许牺牲
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.22,1:38:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.72,1:38:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸？你看
Dialogue: 0,1:38:16.39,1:38:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好耶！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.22,1:38:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没那么容易甩掉我们的
Dialogue: 0,1:39:01.91,1:39:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,明晚见？拉瑞
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.24,1:39:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 泰迪
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.28,1:39:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次我可能搞不定了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.71,1:39:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,若真是那样
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.95,1:39:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么就此道别了 朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.82,1:39:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.66,1:39:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲是英雄
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.03,1:39:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.43,1:39:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你说过了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.54,1:39:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.67,1:39:38.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 是早安
Dialogue: 0,1:39:43.68,1:39:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰迪？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.76,1:40:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.01,1:40:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是纽约一台 新闻台
Dialogue: 0,1:40:18.58,1:40:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天地上铺了一层新雪
Dialogue: 0,1:40:21.29,1:40:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过纽约人谈论的可不是这个
Dialogue: 0,1:40:23.86,1:40:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们谈的是雪上的东西 西81街上有恐龙脚印
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.73,1:40:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些脚印是暴龙脚印
Dialogue: 0,1:40:32.23,1:40:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,足迹直接延伸至自然历史博物馆
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.77,1:40:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,当局发现地铁里有史前洞穴画
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.04,1:40:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼安德塔人在博物馆屋顶 这是骗局还是公关活动？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:43.34,1:40:44.57,Note,0,0,0,0,,（家庭影片 博物馆之迷）
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.74,1:40:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,由你来决定 但有件事很确定
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.78,1:40:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,自然历史博物馆的人员 真是使出了浑身绝技
Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.75,1:40:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有何解释？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.26,1:41:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,没 没有解释
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.09,1:41:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:41:02.93,1:41:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要拿回你的钥匙和手电筒
Dialogue: 0,1:41:23.61,1:41:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家 跟我来
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.37,1:42:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫尼克达理 我的职场父母要介绍的是我爸
Dialogue: 0,1:42:27.55,1:42:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是自然历史博物馆的夜班警卫
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.72,1:42:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克说过了
Dialogue: 0,1:42:37.86,1:42:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是自然历史博物馆的夜班警卫
Dialogue: 0,1:42:40.43,1:42:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那里 历史栩栩如生
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.66,1:42:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有多少人到过那里？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.19,1:43:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,得分！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:39.48,1:43:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 时间晚了 你要回家了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:42.45,1:43:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没
Dialogue: 0,1:43:49.96,1:43:51.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲啊
Dialogue: 0,1:44:29.05,1:44:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉瑞很好心没举发我们 不过这太扯了
Dialogue: 0,1:44:32.62,1:44:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是夜班警卫 不是清洁工
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.69,1:44:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好好干
Dialogue: 0,1:44:37.79,1:44:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去打个盹
Dialogue: 0,1:44:39.29,1:44:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能走
Dialogue: 0,1:44:40.93,1:44:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,快给我拖地
Dialogue: 0,1:44:48.03,1:44:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边
